Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.一个黑暗和暴风雨的万圣节。\N...a dark and stormy Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好，欢迎收看八点的GC-1新闻直播。\NGood evening and welcome to GC-1 News live at 8:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚的头条新闻，刚刚公布的民调显示现任市长小唐·米切尔。\NOur top story tonight, just-released polls have incumbent Mayor Don Mitchell, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,和28岁的草根挑战者贝拉Reál在竞争中难分难解。\Nand 28-year-old grassroots challenger Bella Reál in a dead heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在下周二大选前的最后一场辩论中，昨晚的形势变得非常激烈。\NThings certainly got hot last night in their final debate before next Tuesday's election.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，我的年轻对手想毁掉伟大的托马斯·韦恩建立的，哥谭复兴计划。\NNow, my young opponent here wants to gut the Gotham Renewal Program, established by the great Thomas Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,削减重要项目的资金，比如我们的海堤和为那些需要它的人建立的安全网。\NCutting funds from vital projects like our sea wall and the safety net for those who need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,更新计划失败了。这座城市已经更新了20年。\NThe Renewal Program is broken. This city's been renewing for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们现在的处境。犯罪率飙升。\NLook where it's gotten us. Crime has skyrocketed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谋杀和吸毒都达到了历史新高。\NMurder and drug use are at historic highs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在等待…现在挂在。\NNow wait... Now hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.53,0:02:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有个蒙面治安维持者在街上横行。\NWe have a masked vigilante running the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在我的领导下，哥谭警局打击了有组织犯罪和毒品走私。\NUnder my administration, the Gotham PD has dealt major blows to organized crime and drug trafficking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,塞尔瓦托·马罗尼案是本市历史上最大的缉毒案。\NThe Salvatore Maroni case was the biggest drug bust in city history.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.46,0:02:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是毒品和其他毒品仍然猖獗。\NBut drops and other drugs are still rampant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它变得更糟。\NIt's gotten worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说没有工作可做。\NI'm not saying there isn't work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但听…我有个漂亮的妻子和年幼的儿子，好吗?\NBut listen... I have a beautiful wife and young son, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我将永不停歇……\NAnd I will not rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，我正在看。\NYeah, I'm watching it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么她还绑着?\NWhy is she still tied?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但我以为《华盛顿邮报》的民意调查会有进展。\NBut I thought we were getting a bump in the new Post poll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，你知道吗?我看不下去了。\NOkay, you know what? I can't watch this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,明早打给我，好吗?\NJust call me in the morning, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.仍然相信这座城市所能做的一切。\N...who still believes in everything this city can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一个领导者，米切尔先生，而不是啦啦队长。\NWe need a leader, Mr. Mitchell, not a cheerleader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一个能告诉人们真相的人。\NAnd someone who will tell the people the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,周四,10月31日。\NThursday, October 31st.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,城里的街道因节日而拥挤不堪。\NThe city streets are crowded for the holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,即使下雨了。\NEven with the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,隐藏在混乱中的是元素，像蛇一样等待着攻击。\NHidden in the chaos is the element, waiting to strike like snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.59,0:05:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也在那里。\NBut I'm there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,观看。\NWatching.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,两年的黑夜把我变成了夜行动物。\NTwo years of nights have turned me into a nocturnal animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.23,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须仔细选择我的目标。\NI must choose my targets carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,——加油!把钱给我。——好的。\N- Come on! Give me the money. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,——走吧!我们走吧!-好了，好了!\N- Let's go! Let's go! - All right, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个大城市。\NIt's a big city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能无处不在。\NI can't be everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们不知道我在哪。\NBut they don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这家伙，伙计。\NLook at this guy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:06:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那么好,人。这就是我说的!\NSo good, man. That's what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看你的成绩。\NYo, let's see your hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你的。\NThat's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在有信号了。当需要我的时候。\NWe have a signal now. For when I'm needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但当那道光照射到天空时，它就不仅仅是一个信号了。\NBut when that light hits the sky, it's not just a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个警告。\NIt's a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们。\NTo them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧……\NFear...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个工具。\Nis a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?看路，矮胖子!\NAre you out of your mind? Watch where you're goin', drophead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为我躲在暗处。\NThey think I'm hiding in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!\NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.72,0:08:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但我是影子。\NBut I am the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:08:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-快点，快点。——哇!\N- Come on, come on. - Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿，继续，伙计!走吧!——让他!\N- Hey, go on, man! Go! - Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-来吧，伙计!-你在干什么?\N- Come on, man! - What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,的帮助!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.29,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来救救我啊!\NSomebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.29,0:09:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,救命,救命!\NHelp, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪?\NWhere you goin', huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧。\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,男人。打破它。\NCome on, man. Break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你动不了，是吧?\NYou can't move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在把他打晕。\NNow knock his ass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏上演。Showtime,老兄。\NShowtime. Showtime, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,男人。\NCome on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.07,0:09:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧。这么做,男人。\NCome on. Do it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到这个人了吗?\NYou see this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈到底是什么意思?\NThe hell are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是复仇。\NI'm vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐这是他。\NHoly shit. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,男人。不,不,不!\NHey, man. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要伤害我。\NPlease don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，哇，哇，哇。\NWhoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,警方的行动。\NPolice action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我在一起，警官。\NHe's with me, Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗，先生?\NAre you kidding me, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.84,0:12:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你要让他进来吗?\NYou're gonna let him in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁内斯，让他过去。\NMartinez, let him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的怪物。\NGoddamn freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道什么?\NWhat do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,侦探吗?\NDetective?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.72,0:13:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,中尉。\NSorry, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有钝器伤。头部有撕裂伤。\NWe got blunt force trauma. Lacerations on the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他被打了很多次。和努力。\NHe got hit a lot of times. And hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这些血都是他头上的吗?\NAll this blood is from his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.91,0:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不。\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我。\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分是他的手。\NMost of it's from his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拇指被切了下来。\NThumb was severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.76,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手可能把它当战利品拿走了。\NKiller may have taken it as a trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,被切断的时候他还活着。\NHe was alive when it was cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.56,0:14:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,瘀斑……在伤口周围。\NEcchymosis... around the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下的保安说他们家出去玩不给糖就捣蛋了。\NSecurity detail downstairs said the family was out trick-or-treatin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,市长一个人在这里。\NThe mayor was up here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手可能是从天窗进来的。\NKiller may have come through the skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你说有卡片。\NYou said there was a card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“你的秘密朋友。喔?\N"From your secret friend. Whoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没有一个线索?\NHaven't a clue?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来玩个游戏，就你和我。\NLet's play a game, just me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,撒谎的人死后会做什么?”\NWhat does a liar do when he's dead?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个密码。\NThere's a cipher too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这些对你有什么意义吗?\NAny of this mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?\NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他来的，皮特。\NI asked him to come, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是犯罪现场。\NThis is a crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是米奇尔，天啊!\NIt's Mitchell, for chrissakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,媒体都在楼下。\NI got the press downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经放你一马了，吉姆，因为我们有过节。\NYou know, I cut you a lot of slack, Jim, 'cause we got history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但这太过分了。\NBut this is way over the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.91,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等待。\NWait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.07,0:15:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-他也参与了?-不，他没有参与。\N- He's involved in this? - No, he's not involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\NHow do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个该死的治安维护者!他可能是嫌疑犯!\NHe's a goddamn vigilante! He could be a suspect!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你在对我做什么?我们以前是搭档。\NWhat are you doin' to me? We used to be partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.00,0:16:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想找出其中的联系，皮特。\NI'm just trying to find the connection, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他仍然是。\NHe lies still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我吗?\NExcuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谜题。\NThe riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,说谎的人死后会做什么?他仍然是。\NWhat does a liar do when he's dead? He lies still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,耶稣。\NOh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这一定是你一年中最喜欢的夜晚，对吧，伙计?\NThis must be your favorite night of the year, huh, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的万圣节快乐。\NHappy fuckin' Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,专员。\NExcuse me, Commissioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们准备好听你的陈述了。\NThey're ready for your statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我要他离开这里。\NI want him outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在!\NNow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧。\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.15,0:17:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.61,0:17:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子找到了他。\NThe kid found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你来的时候房子里还有其他人吗?\NWas there anyone else in the house when you arrived?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的得走了，伙计。\NWe really gotta go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚，一个儿子失去了父亲。\NTonight, a son lost a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,妻子失去了丈夫。\NA wife lost a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我失去了一个朋友。\NAnd I lost a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,米切尔市长是这座城市的斗士，在找到杀害他的凶手之前我不会罢休。\NMayor Mitchell was a fighter for the city, and I will not rest until his killer is found.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:18:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一起毫无意义的犯罪，我们正在积极追查我们掌握的每一条调查线索以确定行凶者并将他缉拿归案。\NThis was a truly senseless crime, and we are actively pursuing every investigative lead we have in order to identify the perpetrator and hunt him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟州长谈过了我希望我能说我在做出改变，但我不知道。\NI've spoken to the governor... I wish I could say I'm making a difference, but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谋杀、抢劫、攻击。\NMurder, robberies, assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,两年后，他们都成立了。\NTwo years later, they're all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在这个。\NAnd now this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.90,0:18:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这个城市正在吞噬自己。\NThe city's eating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也许已经无法挽救了。\NMaybe it's beyond saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但我得试试。\NBut I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.62,0:18:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,推动自己。\NPush myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.96,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这些夜晚都在面具后面匆匆地滚动着。\NThese nights all roll together in a rush behind the mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候早上，我得强迫自己记起来\NSometimes in the morning, I have to force myself to remember
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,当时所发生的一切。\Neverything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.61,0:20:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这一小时的突发新闻让人难以置信。\NUnbelievable breaking news this hour, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,四届现任高谭市市长小唐·米切尔。\NAgain, four-term incumbent Gotham Mayor Don Mitchell, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚被发现在他位于克雷斯特山区的家中被谋杀。\Nwas found murdered last night inside his home in the exclusive Crest Hill district.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.00,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,犯罪的具体细节还没有公布，但警方和联邦调查局已经在全市范围内搜捕这名厚颜无耻的凶手。\NExact details of the crime still have not been released, but a citywide manhunt is already underway as police and FBI search for the brazen killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这当然不是哥谭市第一次因政治人物被谋杀而震动。\NAnd this certainly is not the first time Gotham has been rocked by the murder of a political figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上，一个奇怪的巧合是，20年前的这周著名的亿万富翁慈善家托马斯·韦恩医生和他的妻子玛莎在韦恩自己的市长竞选中被杀。\NIn fact, in an eerie coincidence, it was 20 years ago this week that celebrated billionaire philanthropist Dr. Thomas Wayne and his wife Martha were slain during Wayne's own mayoral campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一桩令人震惊的案件，至今仍未破案。\NIt was a shocking crime that remains unsolved to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小唐·米切尔的政治生涯尤其以他对毒品的严厉打击而闻名，当时他和市警察发起了一次重大的诱捕行动，\NDon Mitchell, Jr.'s political career was especially notable for his tough war on drugs when he and city police launched a major sting operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.20,0:20:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,最终逮捕了臭名昭著的黑手党头目塞尔瓦托·马洛尼，这也是哥谭市警局历史上最大规模的缉毒行动。\Nresulting in the arrest of notorious mafia crime figure Salvatore Maroni with what, to this day, remains the biggest drug bust in GCPD history.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你已经听说了。\NI assume you heard about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,我明白了。\NOh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这些血都是他头上的吗?\NAll this blood is from his head?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.69,0:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的上帝。\NDear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.66,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一个密码。\NThere's a cipher too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.71,0:21:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这些对你有什么意义吗?\NAny of this mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手把这个留给了蝙蝠侠?\NThe killer left this for the Batman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.38,0:21:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫他来的，皮特。\NI asked him to come, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,显然。\NApparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经成了名人了。\NYou're becoming quite a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.35,0:21:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么写信给你?\NWhy is he writing to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.77,0:21:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是米奇尔，天啊!\NIt's Mitchell, for chrissakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.27,0:21:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不知道。\NI don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.39,0:21:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我把媒体叫到楼下了。\NI got the press downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个淋浴。\NHave a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.69,0:22:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们韦恩集团的会计朋友要来吃早餐。\NOur accounting friends at Wayne Enterprises are coming for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里吗?为什么?\NHere? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我没法让你去那里。\NBecause I couldn't get you to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我没时间理你。\NI haven't got time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,事情越来越严重了，布鲁斯。\NIt's getting serious, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这样下去，过不了多久你就一无所有了。\NIf this continues, it won't be long before you've nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.79,0:22:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我不关心这个。\NI don't care about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,任何的。\NAny of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.25,0:22:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你不关心你家族的遗产吗?\NYou don't care about your family's legacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我所做的是我家族的遗产。\NWhat I'm doing is my family's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不能改变这里的事情，如果我不能产生影响，那我就不在乎发生在我身上的事情。\NIf I can't change things here, if I can't have an effect, then I don't care what happens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我所担心的。\NThat's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.97,0:22:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德,停下来。\NAlfred, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是我父亲。\NYou're not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我很清楚。\NI'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.97,0:23:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们真的得走了，伙计。\NWe really gotta go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,一些新鲜的浆果。\NSome fresh berries there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在回忆我在马戏团的日子。\NJust reminiscing about my days in the Circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.18,0:23:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这实际上是非常难以理解的。\NThis is actually quite elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你哪来的O ?\NWhere'd you get those O's?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.32,0:24:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,“他静静地躺着”只是部分的关键。\N"He lies still" is only a partial key.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.20,0:24:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它只给出H E L I S和T。\NIt only gives us H, E, L, I, S, and T.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我在找任何双符号开始，试着字母，看看能指向哪里。\NSo, I'm looking for any double symbols to start, trying letters, see where it leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这很有趣。\NThat's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.37,0:24:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,一便士的先生吗?\NMr. Pennyworth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,平底小渔船?\NYes, Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,会计来了。\NThe accountants are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,请让他们进来，多莉。\NSee them in, please, Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.51,0:24:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果它不是部分密钥呢?\NWhat if it's not a partial key?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.80,0:24:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思?\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这就是整把钥匙呢?\NWhat if this is the whole key?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,忽略那些没有字母表示的符号。\NIgnore the symbols we don't have letters for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只用“He lie still”中的字母，其余的就不用了……空白。是的,我明白了。\NUse only the letters from "He lies still" and leave the rest... Blank. Yeah, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,但这将使大部分的密码悬而未决。\NBut that would leave most of the cipher unsolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这怎么能…\NI don't see how that's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦。\NOh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.63,0:25:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的。\NDamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，他有车。\NYeah, he's got a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.63,0:25:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看来当市长挺好的。\NGuess it's good to be the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.09,0:25:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪里开始呢?\NWhere to even start?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.34,0:25:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定这不是一个飞跃吗?“开车”可以是任何意思。\NYou sure this isn't a leap? "Drive" could mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.76,0:25:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不相信我?\NYou don't trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说你信任我吗?\NYou mean like you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.48,0:25:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都两年了，我都不知道你是谁。\NIt's been two years now, and I don't even know who you are, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里。\NThere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在找什么?\NWhat are we looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.51,0:25:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一个USB端口。\NA USB port.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,USB吗?\NUSB?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.35,0:26:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.90,0:26:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,“拇指”。\N"Thumb" drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.94,0:26:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.20,0:26:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它是加密的。\NIt's encrypted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,试试这个。\NTry this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.42,0:26:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙太搞笑了。\NOh, this guy's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，好吧，好吧，好吧。\NOh, well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.68,0:26:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是家庭价值观。\NSo much for family values.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁?\NWho is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.35,0:26:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道。\NNo idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.86,0:26:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但那是企鹅，卡迈·福肯的右手。\NBut that's the Penguin, Carmine Falcone's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.03,0:26:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁。\NI know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.99,0:26:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\NWhat was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.74,0:26:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的,他妈的!驱动器。\NShit, shit! The drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.33,0:27:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,它从我的账户发送了照片。\NIt sent out the photos from my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.75,0:27:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,《哥谭邮报》，《公报》，GC-1，所有这些。\NGotham Post, Gazette, GC-1, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.37,0:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.54,0:27:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我要为此下地狱。皮特会气疯的。\NI'm gonna catch hell for this. Pete's gonna bust a gasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.00,0:27:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,“他仍然谎言。”\N"He lies still."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.67,0:27:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,关于她吗?\NAbout her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧。\NMaybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那是冰山休息室。\NThat's the Iceberg Lounge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就在海岸线公寓下面法尔科内藏身的地方。\NIt's under the Shoreline Lofts where Falcone was holed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.18,0:27:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没有搜查令绝不能进去。\NNever get in there without a warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.82,0:27:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,知道我是谁吗?\NKnow who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.37,0:27:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。我有个主意。\NYeah. I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.08,0:27:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我想去看企鹅。\NI want to see the Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.21,0:27:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么，伙计。\NI don't know what you're talking about, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.84,0:27:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么问题?\NWhat's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.92,0:27:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他想见企鹅。\NSays he wants to see the Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.43,0:27:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,企鹅吗?这里没有企鹅。\NPenguin? There's no Penguin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想这么跟他说。\NThat's what I tried to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.39,0:28:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去，怪胎。你听到我吗?\NGet out of here, freak. You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不然那小西装就会全是血了。\NOr that little suit's gonna get all full of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.02,0:28:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的还是你的?\NMine or yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.44,0:28:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,得到他!\NGet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.49,0:28:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了整个过程。\NI saw that whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.74,0:28:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那里!\NHe's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了?\NWhat is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.03,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!把球棒放下，不然我打爆你的头!\NHey! Put the bat down, or I'll blow your head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.80,0:29:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哇，哇，哇，哇!\NWhoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别紧张，亲爱的。\NTake it easy, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.55,0:29:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找我吗?\NYou looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过那对双胞胎了。\NI see you met the twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子，你是他们所说的一切，不是吗?\NBoy, you're everything they say, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.10,0:29:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们都是。\NI guess we both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.65,0:29:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你过得如何?\NHow you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.69,0:29:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是Oz。\NI'm Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.66,0:29:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她是谁?\NWho is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.95,0:29:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不知道，长官。\NI really don't know, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.58,0:29:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能会同时出柜，但我不会和他们一起。\NI might have been coming out at the same time, but I wasn't rolling with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系,宝贝。\NIt's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.22,0:30:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇先生，他不咬人。来吧。\NMr. Vengeance here, he don't bite. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.75,0:30:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,亲爱的。\NThank you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.47,0:30:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,给你，冠军。\NHere you go, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.39,0:30:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道她是谁，她和这起谋杀案有什么关系。\NI wanna know who she is, and what she has to do with this murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.02,0:30:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,——谁的谋杀?——市长的。\N- Whose murder? - The mayor's.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.31,0:30:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那是市长吗?\NIs that the mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.77,0:30:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，该死，就是这样。看看这个。\NOh, shit, it is. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.77,0:30:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我伤害你。\NDon't make me hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.15,0:31:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好小心点。你知道我的名声吗?\NYou better watch it. You know my reputation?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,我做的。你呢?\NYeah, I do. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来……我只是业主，好吗?\NLook... I'm just the proprietor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.50,0:31:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，这里的人做什么跟我一点关系都没有。\NI mean, what people do here ain't got nothing to do with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你一件事。\NTell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.89,0:31:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不管她是谁，她真是个辣妹。\NWhoever she is, she's one hot chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.98,0:31:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不问问米奇尔的妻子?也许她知道。\NWhy don't you ask Mitchell's wife? Maybe she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.73,0:31:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?太早了吗?\NWhat? Too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.41,0:31:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么需要帮忙的尽管说。\NYou let me know if there's anything else I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.09,0:32:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车!\NTaxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车!\NTaxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.36,0:32:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,是我。\NHey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.95,0:32:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝,怎么了?\NBaby, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.95,0:32:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哇,哇,哇。慢点，慢点。我不能……\NWhoa, whoa, whoa. Slow down, slow down. I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.41,0:32:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,上新闻了吗?\NOn the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.50,0:32:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧。不。不,呆在那里。等等我，好吗?\NOkay. No. No, stay there. Wait for me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.88,0:32:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我，我在回家的路上。\NWait for me, I'm on my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.75,0:32:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，宝贝，我们会离开这里的，好吗?我保证。\NListen, baby, we're gonna get the hell out of here, okay? I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.09,0:32:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们必须早点走，我们今晚就走。\NIf we have to leave earlier, we'll leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.64,0:32:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…\NUh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.02,0:32:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的。\NGod damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.33,0:33:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.被谋杀市长小唐·米切尔的照片。\N...photos of murdered mayor, Don Mitchell, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.41,0:33:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,和一个年轻的神秘女人。\Nwith a younger mystery woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.37,0:33:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,令人震惊的是，警方认为照片本身……\NIn a shocking development, the police believe the photos themselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.66,0:34:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们敦促她联系哥谭市警局…\NNow they urge her to contact the GCPD...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.09,0:36:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这方面很在行。\NYou're pretty good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.96,0:36:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!给我。\NHey! Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.79,0:36:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,“Kosolov,安妮卡。”\N"Kosolov, Annika."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.84,0:36:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他伤害了她吗?所以你才杀了他?\NHe hurt her? That's why you killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.01,0:37:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?哦,请。给我那该死的…\NWhat? Oh, please. Just give me the goddamn...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.84,0:37:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，亲爱的，你想错了?\NListen, honey, you got the wrong idea, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我没杀任何人。我是来找我朋友的。\NI didn't kill anybody. I'm here for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.10,0:37:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她想要离开这里，而这个混蛋偷了她的护照。\NShe's trying to get the hell out of here, and this son of a bitch stole her passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.39,0:37:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道什么?\NWhat does she know?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.85,0:37:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是什么，她都很害怕，都不肯告诉我。\NWhatever it is, it's got her so spooked she won't even tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.06,0:37:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,她看起来确实很难过。\NShe did seem upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.44,0:37:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,回你家去了。\NBack at your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.99,0:38:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去和她谈谈。\NLet's go talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.68,0:38:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,安妮!\NAnni!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.06,0:38:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝!\NBaby!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.73,0:38:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,安妮!\NAnni!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,安妮!\NAnni!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.57,0:38:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚天气会很凉爽。\NIt's gonna be cool this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.03,0:38:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,会降到40度。\NIt's gonna be down into the 40s.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.78,0:38:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,更多突发新闻，这座城市连续几晚发生了第二起备受瞩目的谋杀案。\NMore breaking news this hour as the city is rocked by a second high-profile murder in as many nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.75,0:38:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而这一次，凶手主动提出在网上邀功…天啊，他们要对她做什么?她只是个孩子。\NAnd this time, the killer has come forward to claim credit online... Jesus, what are they gonna do to her? She's just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.84,0:39:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,该死，他们拿走了我的手机。\NShit, they took my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.67,0:39:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,死者，长期担任哥谭市警局局长的皮特·萨维奇局长，今晚早些时候被发现死于特里科纳地区警察体育联盟的设施内。\NHis victim, longtime head of the Gotham City PD, Commissioner Pete Savage, was found dead earlier tonight inside the Police Athletic League facilities in the Tricorner area.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.14,0:39:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,凶手在社交媒体上发布了以下信息，我们必须警告你，这段视频非常令人不安。\NThe killer posted the following message on social media, and we have to warn you, the video is very disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.53,0:39:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你好，高谭市的人们。\NHello, people of Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是谜语人。\NThis is the Riddler speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,万圣节之夜，我杀了你们的市长因为他不是他假装的那个人。\NOn Halloween night, I killed your mayor because he was not who he pretended to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.37,0:39:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还没说完。\NBut I am not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.59,0:39:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是另一个……\NHere is another...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.26,0:39:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他很快就会丢面子。\Nwho will soon be losing face.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.39,0:40:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我会一次又一次地杀人，直到我们的审判日，当关于我们城市的真相最终…被揭露了。\NI will kill again, and again, and again, until our day of judgment when the truth about our city will finally... be unmasked.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.99,0:40:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,再见!\NGoodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.99,0:40:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,萨维奇专员在哥谭市警局工作了30年…我的天，我也见过那家伙。\NCommissioner Savage served a distinguished 30-year career on the GCPD... Holy shit, I seen that guy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.50,0:40:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,在俱乐部。\NAt the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.17,0:40:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,冰山休息室吗?\NThe Iceberg Lounge?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.34,0:40:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,44所示。\N44 Below.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.72,0:40:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.97,0:40:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,俱乐部中的俱乐部。\NThe club within the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.60,0:40:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的俱乐部。\NThe real club.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是黑帮的聚集地。\NIt's a mob hangout.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.02,0:40:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里工作吗?\NIs that where you work?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,塞琳娜?\NSelina?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.07,0:40:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我只是在楼上的酒吧工作。\NNo, I just work the bar upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.41,0:40:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但我看到他们进来了。\NBut I see 'em come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.04,0:40:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谁?\NWho?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你，很多人不应该出现在那里。\NA lot of guys that shouldn't be there, I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你基本的正直公民类型。\NYour basic upstanding citizen types.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.76,0:41:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你得帮我。\NYou're gonna help me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.93,0:41:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为你的朋友。\NFor your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.02,0:41:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你养了很多猫。\NYou got a lot of cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.86,0:41:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我对流浪狗有偏见。\NI have a thing about strays.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.91,0:41:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里不安全。\NYou're not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.37,0:41:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己。\NI can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.62,0:41:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,两名公众人物在选举前两天晚上去世。\NTwo public figures now dead in just the last two nights, and only days before the election.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.12,0:41:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,警察和市政府官员都在寻找凶手，希望在他再次杀人之前找到他。\NPolice and city officials are left searching for a killer and hoping to find him before he kills again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.31,0:42:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他在体育馆等他。\NHe waited for him at the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.61,0:42:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,皮特总是喜欢在没有别人的时候工作到深夜。\NPete always liked to work out late at night, when no one else was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.99,0:42:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他脖子上有针孔。\NThere's a needle mark on his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.49,0:42:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,给他注射了砷。\NInjected him with arsenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.45,0:42:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,老鼠药。\NRat poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.58,0:42:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.33,0:42:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这似乎是他的主题。\NThat seems to be his theme here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.34,0:42:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个东西。\NLook at this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.85,0:42:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个迷宫。\NIt's a maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.18,0:42:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的疯子会对人做这种事?\NWhat kind of demented son of a bitch does this to a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.23,0:42:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的符号。\NMore symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.82,0:42:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这是另一个密码。\NIt's another cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.49,0:42:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在他的信息被疯传后，他把这些都炸了。\NHe blasted these out after his message went viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.91,0:42:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这混蛋毁了你和你的名誉。\NBastard murders you and your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.58,0:43:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙推的是药水。在东端。\NThat guy pushes drops. On the east end.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.29,0:43:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白。\NI don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.71,0:43:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么皮特要卷入这种事?\NWhy would Pete get involved in something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.00,0:43:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来他很贪心。\NLooks like he got greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.09,0:43:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗?\NYou kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.21,0:43:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为扳倒马龙尼家族做了那么多?\NAfter everything we did to take down the Maronis?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.01,0:43:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们摧毁了他们的整个行动，然后他就向某个卑鄙的毒贩屈服了?\NWe busted their entire operation, then he caves to some lowlife dealer?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.34,0:43:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他不是你想的那样。\NMaybe he's not who you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.10,0:43:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得好像是他自找的。\NYou make it sound like he had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.39,0:43:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个警察。\NHe was a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.19,0:43:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,穿过一条线。\NCrossed a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.72,0:44:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,“我为你疯狂。\N"I'm mad about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.47,0:44:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,想知道我的名字吗?看看里面就知道了。”\NWant to know my name? Just look inside and see."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.27,0:44:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,“沿着迷宫走，直到你找到老鼠。\N"Follow the maze until you find the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.53,0:44:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,把他带到阳光下，你就会知道我在什么地方了。”\NBring him into the light, and you'll find where I'm at."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.20,0:44:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?\NThe hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.66,0:44:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"让他见光明"?“找到老鼠”?\N"Bring him into the light"? "Find the rat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.96,0:44:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道。\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.33,0:44:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,中尉。\NLieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.58,0:44:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来了。\NThey're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.09,0:44:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里。\NWe got to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.42,0:44:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧。\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.72,0:44:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,噢!\NOw!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.22,0:44:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道这些事。\NI don't know about these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.64,0:44:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看看里面，这个狩猎场。\NI need to see in there, this hunting ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.11,0:44:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我开始觉得自己像上钩的鱼了?\NHey, why am I starting to feel like a fish on a hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.57,0:45:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在找安妮卡。\NI'm just looking for Annika.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.33,0:45:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，你真是个甜心。\NBoy, you're a real sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不在乎我今晚在里面会发生什么，是吗?\NYou really don't care what happens to me in there tonight, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.26,0:45:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我。\NLook at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.10,0:45:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不错。在这里。\NLooks good. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.44,0:46:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我得到了你。你能听到我说话吗?\NI got you. Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.40,0:46:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.08,0:46:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，你要去哪?\NHey, where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,款待。\NHospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.58,0:46:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是那天晚上和我吵起来的人之一。\NThat's one of the guys I got into it with the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.21,0:46:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我打断了他的鼻子。\NLooks like I broke his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.39,0:46:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,“Kenzie,威廉。”\N"Kenzie, William."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.55,0:46:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个不当班的警察。\NHe's an off-duty cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.89,0:46:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定没人能从我眼睛里看到这些东西吗?\NAre you sure no one can see these things in my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.89,0:46:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心。我在看你。\NDon't worry. I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.49,0:47:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来不走了。我需要时间做身份证。\NDon't look away. I need time to make IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.71,0:47:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了。\NGreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.09,0:47:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这些人不太擅长眼神交流，对吧?\NThese guys have a little problem with eye contact, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.47,0:47:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很好，不是吗?\NFeels good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.14,0:47:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,宝贝。感觉真的好。\NYeah, baby. Feels real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.39,0:47:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，我讨厌水滴头。\NJesus, I hate dropheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.10,0:47:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\NReally?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.23,0:47:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我第一次见到你的时候，你好像在为企鹅贩毒。\N'Cause when I first saw you, it looked like you were dealing for Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.57,0:47:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道你在说什么。我们可以不…我们现在能别谈这个吗?\NYou don't know what you're talking about. Can we not... Can we not do this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.11,0:47:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等待。是谁呢?\NWait. Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.74,0:47:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，我看到他了。\NOh, I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.99,0:47:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,回头。\NLook back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.16,0:47:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我回头看，会发现一堆虫子。\NIf I look back, it's gonna be a whole can of worms.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.04,0:47:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看到他的脸。\NI need to see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.04,0:47:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.51,0:48:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是达。\NThat's the DA.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.76,0:48:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尔·。\NGil Colson.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.88,0:48:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他过来了。你快乐吗?\NAnd he's coming over. You happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.64,0:48:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说话。\NTalk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.97,0:48:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。你过得如何?\NHey. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.14,0:48:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨。\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.31,0:48:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我是吉尔。\NI'm Gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.35,0:48:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是地方检察官吗?\NHey, aren't you the DA?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.06,0:48:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,哇。我在电视上见过你。\NWow. I've seen you on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.48,0:48:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗?\NIs that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.28,0:48:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前没在这附近见过你。\NI haven't seen you around here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.49,0:48:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对新人来说这是个糟糕的时期，因为大家都有点紧张。\NIt's a hell of a time to be the new girl, 'cause people are all a little on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.24,0:48:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我生活在边缘。\NOh, honey, I live on the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.83,0:48:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗?\NIs that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.12,0:48:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢这样。\NI like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.71,0:48:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你想过来吗?\NDo you want to come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.83,0:48:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,确定。\NSure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.96,0:48:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是崔维斯。-嗨。\N- This is Travis. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.38,0:48:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你想坐那边吗?\NYou wanna take a seat over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.09,0:48:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,——格伦里奇。-嗨。\N- Richie, Glen. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.43,0:48:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是半个地检办公室的人。\NThat's half the DA's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.01,0:48:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识卡拉吧?\NYou know Carla here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.26,0:48:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨。\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.30,0:48:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是谢利。别理她，她只是在休息。\NThat's Cheri. Don't mind her, she's just taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.43,0:48:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,淹没我们的痛苦。\NDrowning our sorrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.64,0:48:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你想喝一杯吗?\NYou want a drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.02,0:49:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我很好。但是你喜欢。\NUh, no, I'm good. But you enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.02,0:49:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你不介意。\NHope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.77,0:49:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有那个疯子在我身边，我负担太重了。\NI got a lot on my shoulders with that psycho running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.28,0:49:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他浪费了。\NHe's wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.32,0:49:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没有大便。\NNo shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.03,0:49:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个女孩。\NI like this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.49,0:49:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，嘿，我也喜欢你!\NOh, hey, I like you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.62,0:49:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，这个谜语人，他的目标是城里最有权势的人。\NI mean, this Riddler, he's going after the most powerful people in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.04,0:49:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道这么多。\NHe knows so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.21,0:49:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他什么都不知道，伙计。\NHe doesn't know shit, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.59,0:49:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?是的,他确实!那只老鼠呢……嘿，吉尔，别这样。\NWhat are you talking about? Yeah, he does! What about that rat... Hey, hey, Gil, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-我觉得你可能喝多了。-嗨。老鼠。\N- Think maybe you had a little too much. - Hey. The rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.92,0:49:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,——慢下来。-问他老鼠的事。\N- Slow down. - Ask him about the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.89,0:49:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，老鼠是怎么回事?\NHey, what's this about a rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.07,0:49:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是……有一只老鼠。我们有个线人。\NI mean... there was a rat. We had an informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有关于塞尔瓦托·马罗尼的重要信息。\NWe had big-time information on Salvatore Maroni.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.78,0:49:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是这样把他从毒品交易中救出来的。\NThat's how we got him out of the drops business.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.58,0:49:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是马罗尼的案子\NHe's talking about the Maroni case.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.24,0:49:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果这家伙知道了，肯定会暴露的。\NBut if this guy knows, it's gonna come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.12,0:50:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,到那时，整个城市都会分崩离析。\NAnd when it does, this whole city's gonna come apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.50,0:50:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，我不想听这些。\NOkay, I don't wanna hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.50,0:50:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样的枕边悄悄话让那个俄罗斯女孩消失了。\NThis is the kind of pillow talk that got that Russian girl disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.21,0:50:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道些什么?\NWhat do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.09,0:50:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想喝一杯吗?\NDoes anybody want a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.34,0:50:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我想喝一杯。\NI want a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.47,0:50:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,让他说话。\NKeep him talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.81,0:50:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，你要去哪?\NWait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.97,0:50:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道安妮卡。\NShe knows Annika.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.10,0:50:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不，继续找地方检察官。\NNo, stay on the DA.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了我在找我的朋友。\NI told you I'm looking for my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.65,0:50:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,——安妮卡在哪里?-从我面前消失。我不认识你。\N- Where's Annika? - Out of my face. I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.86,0:50:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，但你了解她。谁把她?\NYeah, but you know her. Who took her?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.98,0:50:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-你听说了什么?她是好吗?-天啊，小声点。\N- What have you heard? Is she okay? - Jesus Christ, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.61,0:50:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，你想找死?\NWhat, you got a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.95,0:50:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，怎么了，女士们?\NHey, what's the problem, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.49,0:50:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没有问题。只是女孩子之间的谈话。\NThere's no problem. It's just girl talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.49,0:50:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,让这里保持节日气氛，好吗?\NLet's keep it festive down here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.08,0:50:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,确定的事情,Oz。\NSure thing, Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.92,0:50:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.54,0:50:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.80,0:50:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我很久没在这见过你了。\NBeen a long time since I seen you down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.26,0:50:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了?\NHow you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.80,0:50:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，我还好。\NYeah, I've been okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.85,0:51:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是…\NI was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.27,0:51:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我正要上楼。\NI was just headed back upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.86,0:51:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…不要做陌生人。\NWell... don't be a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-你认识卡迈·福肯-我告诉过你这是黑帮聚集地。\N- You know Carmine Falcone. - I told you it's a mob spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.17,0:51:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你没告诉我你和他有关系。\NYou didn't tell me you had a relationship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.84,0:51:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他没有关系，好吗?\NI don't have a relationship with him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.71,0:51:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-看起来不是这样的。——忘记它。\N- Well, that's not what it looked like. - Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.63,0:51:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，你在干什么?\NWait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.80,0:51:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-听着，我不能再这样了。——不!不!\N- Listen, I can't do this anymore. - No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.81,0:51:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车!\NTaxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.77,0:51:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.48,0:51:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我在里面跟丢了。\NI lost you in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.65,0:51:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，我得走了。\NYeah, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.61,0:51:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，你需要搭车吗?\NOh, you need a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.74,0:51:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我。\NThat's me right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.12,0:52:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,出租车!\NTaxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.29,0:52:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好。\NI'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.12,0:52:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望…\NI hope, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.13,0:52:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见。\NI'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.22,0:53:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,只是静静不动。\NJust hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.36,0:54:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你对马罗尼案的线人了解多少?\NWhat do you know about a confidential informant in the Maroni case?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.74,0:54:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，当然有。\NYeah, sure, there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.16,0:54:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我们要找的老鼠。\NThat's the rat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.91,0:54:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,里德尔不知怎么知道他是谁。\NSomehow Riddler knows who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.38,0:54:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们找到那只老鼠，也许能帮我们找到他。\NIf we find the rat, maybe it'll lead us to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.46,0:54:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪弄来的?\NWhere are you getting this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.00,0:55:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个线人今晚跟地方检察官谈过了。\NI have a source who spoke to the DA tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.68,0:55:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尔很紧张。\NGil's very nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.09,0:55:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得凶手的目标是和案子有关系的人。\NI think the killer's targeting people close to that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.72,0:55:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我查过那个案子。\NI worked that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.68,0:55:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谜语人的目标不是你。\NRiddler's not after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.73,0:55:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道?\NHow do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.02,0:55:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不腐败。\NYou're not corrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.48,0:55:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,寇尔森的脏?\NColson's dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.90,0:55:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我…我去追他。逼他交出那只老鼠。\NMaybe I, uh... I go after him. Lean on him to give up the rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.49,0:55:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太危险了。他们和这个人做了个秘密交易。\NIt's too dangerous. They made a secret deal with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.54,0:55:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道会接触到多少人。\NWho knows how many people it touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.42,0:55:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,政客。警察。法庭。\NPoliticians. Police. The courts.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.92,0:55:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,它会把整个城市撕裂。\NIt could tear the whole city apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.05,0:55:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，这简直是火药桶。\NJesus, this is a powder keg.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.72,0:55:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,里德勒就是我要找的人。\NAnd Riddler's the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.34,0:55:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识卡迈·福肯吧。\NYou know Carmine Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.60,0:55:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你这是黑帮聚集地。\NI told you it's a mob spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.97,0:55:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你没告诉我你和他有关系。\NYou didn't tell me you had a relationship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.47,0:55:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有恋爱关系…你没告诉我你和他有关系。\NI don't have a relationship... You didn't tell me you had a relationship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.69,0:55:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他没有关系。好吧?\NI don't have a relationship with him. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.48,0:55:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识卡迈·福肯吧。\NYou know Carmine Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.02,0:56:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你这是黑帮聚集地。\NI told you it's a mob spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.15,0:56:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你没告诉我你和他有关系。\NYou didn't tell me you had a relationship with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.86,0:56:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我和他没有关系。好吧?\NI don't have a relationship with him. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.78,0:56:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮。\NPretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.03,0:56:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她是你的新朋友吗?\NShe a new friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.00,0:56:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太确定。\NI'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.04,0:56:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你惹她生气了。\NLooks like you upset her.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.71,0:56:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我该把这当成一个好兆头吗?\NShall I take this as a good sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.92,0:56:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.00,0:56:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你的服装。\NYour attire.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.01,0:56:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩真的会出现吗?\NIs Bruce Wayne making an actual appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.22,0:56:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇尔市长有个公众追悼会。\NThere's a public memorial for Mayor Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.30,0:56:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,连环杀手喜欢跟随人们对他们罪行的反应。\NSerial killers like to follow reactions to their crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.01,0:56:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,里德尔可能无法抗拒。\NRiddler might not be able to resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.68,0:56:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，这倒提醒了我。\NOh, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.31,0:56:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我冒昧地对这个最新的密码做了一点研究。\NI've taken the liberty of doing a little work on this latest cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.81,0:56:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老鼠迷宫里的那个。\NThe one from the rat maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.73,0:56:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕他的西班牙语不太好，但我很确定这句话翻译过来就是"你是El Rata Alada "\NI'm afraid his Spanish is not perfect, but I'm fairly certain this translates to, "You are El Rata Alada."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.99,0:56:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,装Alada吗?\NRata Alada?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.49,0:56:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,“长着翅膀的老鼠”?\N"Rat with wings"?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.79,0:56:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是“鸽子”的俚语。这对你有什么意义吗?\NIt's slang for "pigeon." Does that mean anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.37,0:56:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.08,0:57:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一个诱饵。\NA stool pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.46,0:57:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你的袖扣呢?\NWhere are your cufflinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.17,0:57:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我找不到他们。\NI couldn't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.59,0:57:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能就这样出去。\NWell, you can't go out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.63,0:57:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德，我不要你的袖扣。\NAlfred, I don't want your cufflinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.60,0:57:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你得装模作样。你还是韦恩家的人。\NYou have to keep up appearances. You're still a Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?你是韦恩家的人吗?\NAnd what about you? Are you a Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.31,0:57:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲给我的。\NYour father gave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.86,0:57:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没有更多的谎言!没有更多的谎言!\NNo more lies! No more lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.18,0:57:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生。好吧。好了，你直接下去。\NMr. Wayne. All right. All right, you're going straight down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.69,0:58:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那是布鲁斯·韦恩吗?\NIs that Bruce Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.53,0:58:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生!韦恩先生!韦恩先生!\NMr. Wayne! Mr. Wayne! Mr. Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.25,0:58:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,等等。\NHold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你好,伙计们?\NYou good, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.42,0:58:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好。\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.54,0:58:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事，法尔科内先生。\NWe're good, Mr. Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.44,0:58:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,先生?\NSir?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.13,0:59:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.17,0:59:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,离我们远点，好吗，小滑头?\NGive us a wide berth here, would you, slick?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.13,0:59:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们，小心点。\NHey, watch it, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.42,0:59:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,城里的王子在那里。\NYou got the prince of the city there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.55,0:59:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一些事件,嗯?\NSome event, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.47,0:59:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,带出了城里唯一一个比我更隐遁的人。\NBrought out the one guy in the city more reclusive than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.52,0:59:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你永远不会离开海岸酒店呢。\NThought you'd never leave the Shoreline.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.06,0:59:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你不怕有人朝你开枪吗?\NAren't you afraid someone'll take a shot at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.77,0:59:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?因为你父亲不在?\NWhy? 'Cause your father ain't around?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.65,0:59:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,奥兹，你认识布鲁斯·韦恩吗?\NOz, you know Bruce Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.69,0:59:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哇。是这样吗?\NWow. Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.24,0:59:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他父亲救了我的命。\NHis father saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.24,0:59:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我胸部中枪了。在这里。\NI got shot in the chest. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.66,0:59:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去医院，所以我们就去了他家门口。\NI couldn't go to no hospital, so we showed up on his doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.46,0:59:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就在餐桌上。\NOperated right on the dining room table.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.75,0:59:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子，他看到了整件事，在楼梯上往下看。\NKid here, he saw the whole thing, up on the stairs looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.42,0:59:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你的脸。\NI remember your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.43,0:59:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这意味着什么吗，是他干的?\NYou don't think that meant something, he did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.76,1:00:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着他宣了希波克拉底誓言。\NIt meant he took the Hippocratic oath.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.23,1:00:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,“希波克拉底誓言”。\N"Hippocratic oath."
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.35,1:00:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这很好。\NThat's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.11,1:00:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我。\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.86,1:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.88,1:00:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，感谢大家参加我们敬爱的市长小唐·米切尔的追悼会。\NLadies and gentlemen, thank you all for coming to today's memorial for our beloved mayor, Don Mitchell, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.17,1:00:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的节目马上就要开始了。\NOur program will begin shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.05,1:00:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,为了提醒大家，他的家人请求那些希望纪念市长的人考虑为他最珍爱的事业捐款... ...哥谭重建基金，我们城市的安全网\NAs a reminder, the family asked that those wishing to honor the mayor's memory consider a donation to the cause most dear to his heart... ...the Gotham Renewal Fund, our city's safety net.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.60,1:00:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,安全网不抓人有什么用?\NWhat good's a safety net doesn't catch anybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.23,1:00:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你，在我女儿需要的时候没有帮助她。\NDidn't help my daughter when she needed it, I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.07,1:00:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙不过是个有钱的人渣。\NThe guy was just another rich scum-sucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.28,1:01:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他是罪有应得。\NHe got what he deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.08,1:01:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,明白我的意思吗?\NKnow what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.37,1:01:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，我不认识你吗?\NHey, don't I know you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.58,1:01:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩。\NBruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.58,1:01:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不回我电话?\NWhy haven't you called me back?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.63,1:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉?\NI'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.92,1:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我是贝拉真实。我要竞选市长。\NI'm Bella Reál. I'm running for mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.34,1:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我本不想打扰你，但你的人一直跟我说你没空。\NI wouldn't be bothering you here, but your people keep telling me you're unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意和我一起走吗?\NWill you walk with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.89,1:01:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生。\NMr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.31,1:01:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生。\NMr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.23,1:01:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的可以为这座城市做更多的事。\NYou know, you really could be doing more for this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.90,1:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家族有慈善史，但据我所知，你什么都没做。\NYour family has a history of philanthropy, but as far as I can tell, you're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.32,1:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我当选，我想改变这一切。\NIf I'm elected, I want to change that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.36,1:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你！\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.53,1:01:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我的上帝。\NMy God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.37,1:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去表达我的敬意。你会等我吗?\NI'm gonna go pay my respects. Will you wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.95,1:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想继续。\NI want to continue this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.79,1:01:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我。\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.71,1:01:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对你失去亲人我深表遗憾。\NI'm so sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.80,1:02:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你！\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.80,1:02:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,长官。我能和你谈谈吗?\NExcuse me, chief. Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.89,1:02:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,吉尔·科尔森失踪了。\NGil Colson is missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.85,1:02:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.22,1:02:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从昨晚起就没有他的消息了。\NHe hasn't been heard from since last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.60,1:02:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,基督,而不是再次。\NChrist, not again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.73,1:02:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。韦恩先生。\NHey. Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.11,1:02:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你找人找他了吗，吉姆?\NYou got people looking for him, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.82,1:02:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,派了几个人去他家。什么都没有。\NSent a couple guys to his house. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.20,1:02:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他妻子怎么说?\NWhat'd his wife say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.20,1:02:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,她没有他的消息。\NShe hadn't heard from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.17,1:03:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,给我下车!\NGet out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.84,1:03:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,从车里出来，举起手来!\NGet out of the car and show your hands!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.47,1:03:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去!\NGet out!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.19,1:03:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,得到他们!\NGet 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.56,1:03:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去!给他们!\NGet out! Show 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.78,1:03:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,基督·。\NChrist, it's Colson.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.45,1:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他脖子上挂着炸弹!\NThere's a bomb around his neck!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.21,1:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就把这里清理干净!\NLet's clear this place out now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.84,1:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把这里清理干净!\NWe've got to get this place cleared out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.71,1:04:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,伙计们,伙计们。我们开始吧。\NHey, guys, guys. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.46,1:04:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道他是否参与了此事。\NWe don't know if he's in on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.01,1:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他在看什么?\NWhat's he looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.11,1:05:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NHoly shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.49,1:05:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗?\NAre you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.24,1:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他到底在干什么?戈登!\NWhat the hell is he doing? Gordon!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.83,1:05:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人会在里面送命的。\NYour guy's gonna get himself killed in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.06,1:05:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请。\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.43,1:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,-是他逼我的-对不起。\N- He made me do it. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.60,1:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他说如果我不按他说的做，他就杀了我。\NHe told me if I didn't do exactly what he said, he'd kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.90,1:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉。\NI'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.40,1:05:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来像是密码锁。\NLooks like a combination lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.15,1:05:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就不能把它切断吗?\NCan't we just cut it off?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.36,1:05:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想保持头脑清醒的话。\NNot if you want to keep your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.73,1:06:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你来了。\NYou came.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.82,1:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.45,1:06:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗?\NMe?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.87,1:06:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有人。\NI'm nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.91,1:06:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个工具，来这里揭露这个我们称之为城市的粪坑的真相。\NI'm just an instrument, here to unmask the truth about this cesspool we call a city.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.25,1:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,“揭露”?\N"Unmask"?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.42,1:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.42,1:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起来，好吗?\NLet's do it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.34,1:06:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在找你。\NI've been trying to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.43,1:06:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你也参与其中。\NYou're part of this too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.85,1:06:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会参与其中?\NHow am I a part of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.72,1:06:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你会看到。\NYou'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.72,1:07:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,首席。你最好看看这个。\NHey, Chief. You better take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.56,1:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,向我的粉丝们问好。\NSay hello to my followers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.73,1:07:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的生活。\NWe're live.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.06,1:07:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是来看我们庭审的。\NThey're here to watch our little trial.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.28,1:07:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,此时此刻，你对面的科尔森先生已经死了。\NAt the moment, the man across from you, Mr. Colson, is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.12,1:07:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，能派个人过来吗?这个疯子会杀了我的!\NJesus, can we get somebody out here? This psycho's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.20,1:07:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但是等一下……闭嘴!你做了那些事，活该去死!\NBut wait a minute... Shut up! You deserve to be dead after what you did!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到我吗?\NYou hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.54,1:07:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧。\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.30,1:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我在给你一个机会。\NI'm giving you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.14,1:07:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没人给过我机会。\NNo one ever gave me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.35,1:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小就很喜欢小谜题。\NNow, ever since I was a child, I've always loved little puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.44,1:07:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说，他们是逃避我们这个世界的恐怖的地方。\NFor me, they are a retreat from the horrors of our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.37,1:08:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们也能给你一些安慰，科尔森先生。\NMaybe they can bring some comfort to you too, Mr. Colson.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.66,1:08:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我猜谜?\NYou want me to do puzzles?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,两分钟猜三个谜语。\NThree riddles in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.83,1:08:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我答案，我就给你锁的密码。\NYou give me the answers, and I'll give you the code for the lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.01,1:08:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-你明白吗?-是的。\N- Do you understand? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.42,1:08:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧,好吧。所以我就……你想让我…第一个谜……“它可能是残酷的，诗意的，或盲目的，但当它被否认时，你会发现它是暴力。”\NOkay, okay. So I just... You want me to... Riddle number one... "It can be cruel, poetic, or blind, but when it's denied, it's violence you may find."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.77,1:08:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,等等,等等,等等!你能再说一遍吗?\NWait, wait, wait! Can you repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.27,1:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,“残酷的”?“诗意”?\N"Cruel"? "Poetic"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.44,1:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,——“正义”。——嗯?\N- "Justice." - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.94,1:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,答案是“正义”。\NThe answer's "justice."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.07,1:08:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,——正义?——是的!\N- Justice? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.36,1:08:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦,上帝。——正义!\N- Oh, God. - Justice!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.03,1:08:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你本应是这座城市的正义使者，与已故市长和警察局长一起，对吗，科尔森先生?\NAnd you were supposed to be an arm of justice in this city, along with the late mayor and police commissioner, were you not, Mr. Colson?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.37,1:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然，当然。当然可以。\NOf course, of course. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.67,1:08:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,第二个谜语。\NRiddle number two.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.13,1:08:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,“如果你是正义的，请不要说谎。\N"If you are justice, please do not lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.34,1:08:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你的瞎眼睛要多少钱?”\NWhat is the price for your blind eye?"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.59,1:09:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,——“价格”?——“贿赂”。\N- "The price"? - "Bribes."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.47,1:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝。“贿赂”?\NOh, God. "Bribes"?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.81,1:09:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他在问你，你要花多少钱才会背弃他。\NHe's asking you how much it cost for you to turn your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.39,1:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,58秒!\NFifty-eight seconds!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.60,1:09:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-多少?——没有!\N- How much? - Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.94,1:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-多少?——十大。一个月10万。\N- How much? - Ten grand. Ten Gs a month.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.23,1:09:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我每个月都能拿到一笔钱，只是为了不起诉某些案件。\NI get a monthly payment just not to prosecute certain cases.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.61,1:09:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况下?\NWhat cases?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.53,1:09:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他没问我这个!\NHe didn't ask me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.74,1:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!十大。\NCome on! Ten grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.20,1:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-这就是我的答案。它是十大!——好的。好吧。好吧。\N- That's my answer. It's ten grand! - Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.24,1:09:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别失去理智，科尔森先生。\NDon't lose your head, Mr. Colson.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.95,1:09:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,在你的时间结束前再来一次。\NJust one more to go before your time runs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.87,1:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的谜。\NLast riddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.37,1:09:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"既然你的正义如此高尚，请告诉我们你是被雇来保护哪些害虫的"\N"Since your justice is so select, please tell us which vermin you're paid to protect."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.17,1:09:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,——“害虫”?——老鼠。\N- "Which vermin"? - The rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.34,1:09:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们保护的那个线人不被塞尔瓦托·马罗尼的案子牵连。\NThe informant you all protect from the Salvatore Maroni case.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.97,1:09:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-你怎么知道的?-他叫什么名字?\N- How do you know about that? - What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.85,1:09:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,二十秒。\NTwenty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.14,1:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,——没有。-他会杀了你的\N- No. - He's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.89,1:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我死定了。你在跟一个死人说话，好吗?\NI'm a dead man either way. You're talking to a dead man, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.94,1:09:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我走这条路，只有我一个人。\NIf I go out this way, it's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.56,1:09:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我说出那个名字，我就有家人，有我爱的人。\NBut if I give over that name, I have family, people I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.77,1:09:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-他也会杀了他们。——谁会?\N- He'll kill them too. - Who will?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.32,1:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-大家都在看。——什么人?\N- People are watching. - What people?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.74,1:09:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,它比你想象的要大得多。\NIt's so much bigger than you could ever imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.95,1:10:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-是整个系统的问题!- 5 !\N- It's the whole system! - Five!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.20,1:10:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,四个!\NFour!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.16,1:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦，上帝，可怜可怜我吧…——三个!\N- Oh, God, have mercy on me... - Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.62,1:10:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,再见!\NGoodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.69,1:10:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他在下面是谁?\NWho do you think he is under there?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.15,1:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要着急。\NTake it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.07,1:10:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看。\NI want to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.40,1:10:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么东西?皮革吗?\NWhat is that thing? Leather?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.37,1:10:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他眼睛上有什么?\NWhat's he got on his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.91,1:10:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在乎呢?我想看看他的脸。\NWho cares? I want to see his face.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.45,1:10:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里做什么?我们把它摘下来吧……嘿!\NWhat are we doing here? Let's just take it off... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.50,1:10:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!嘿!嘿!\NHey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.71,1:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,放松，该死的!\NRelax, God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.46,1:10:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在保护这家伙，吉姆?\NYou're protecting this guy, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.38,1:11:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他介入了一起人质劫持事件。\NHe interfered in an active hostage situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.01,1:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔森的双手沾满了鲜血。\NColson's blood is on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.51,1:11:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是你的。\NMaybe it's on yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.39,1:11:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么?\NWhat'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.52,1:11:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他宁死也不说。\NHe would rather die than talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.68,1:11:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他在害怕什么?\NWhat was he afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你吗?\NYou?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.15,1:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个混蛋。\NYou son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.16,1:11:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你惹上了什么麻烦吗?\NYou have any idea what kind of trouble you're in?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.24,1:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能是谋杀的从犯。\NYou could be an accessory to murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.04,1:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要玩游戏…\NWhy are we playing games...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.16,1:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,得到他!来吧!\NGet him! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.12,1:11:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,后退!后退!\NBack off! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.21,1:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了，现在我以袭警罪告你!\NGreat, now I got you on assaulting an officer!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.59,1:11:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-你指控我袭击了3号。——嘿!\N- You got me on assaulting three. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.75,1:11:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了?这不是解决问题的方法!\NWhat's the matter with you? This isn't the way to do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在太吗?\NYou too now?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.85,1:11:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来处理，队长。给我一分钟。\NLet me handle this, Chief. Just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.47,1:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要为这个人渣冒险吗，吉姆?\NYou're gonna put yourself on the line for this scumbag, Jim?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.14,1:11:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一分钟。我会让他合作的。\NJust give me a minute. I'll get him to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.19,1:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，让他单独待会儿。\NOkay, give him the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.33,1:12:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,两分钟。\NTwo minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.39,1:12:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你听我说。\NYou listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.56,1:12:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得带你离开这里。\NWe gotta get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.23,1:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那会让你备受指责的。\NThat would put a lot of heat on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.27,1:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你打了我的脸。\NWell, you punched me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.19,1:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个关键。\NTake this key.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.78,1:12:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,通过那扇门。走廊通向通向屋顶的楼梯。\NThrough that door. Hallway to the stairs that go to the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.20,1:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，这到底是怎么回事?\NHey, what the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.91,1:12:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，嘿，怎么了?\NHey, hey, hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.58,1:12:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那个留着胡子，鼻子断了的是谁?\NWho's the mustache with the broken nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.38,1:13:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这是Kenzie。毒品。\NThat's Kenzie. Narcotics.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.17,1:13:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我在冰山酒吧认识的人之一。\NHe's one of the guys I got into it with at the Iceberg Lounge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.01,1:13:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?肯齐学院兼职给企鹅?\NWhat are you saying? Kenzie moonlights for the Penguin?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.35,1:13:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他兼职做警察。\NOr he moonlights as a cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.90,1:13:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,——耶稣基督!——走吧!\N- Jesus Christ! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.48,1:13:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有人阻止他!\NSomebody stop him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.19,1:14:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-他在那儿!——别动!\N- There he is! - Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.11,1:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少该克制一下，伙计。\NCould have at least pulled that punch, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.57,1:14:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我做到了。\NI did.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.86,1:14:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,博克对你发了全境通告。你真觉得他跟这事有关吗?\NBock put out an APB on you. You really think he's in on this?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.33,1:14:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个都不相信，你呢?\NI don't trust any of 'em. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.45,1:14:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只相信你。\NI only trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.66,1:15:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,缉毒警察怎么会和法尔科内的得力助手在一起?\NWhat's a narcotics cop doing with Falcone's right-hand man?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.08,1:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,科尔森说:“警察保护老鼠。”也许肯齐也参与其中。\NColson said, "Cops protect the rat." Maybe Kenzie's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.21,1:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为企鹅是告密者?\NYou think Penguin's the rat?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.42,1:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他的俱乐部是为暴民服务的。马罗尼实际上就住在那里。\NHis club caters to the mob. Maroni practically lived there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.55,1:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,企鹅应该知道很多内幕。\NPenguin would have been privy to a lot of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.59,1:15:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,DA也是个常客。\NDA was a regular too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.01,1:15:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许企鹅给自己惹了麻烦做笔交易是他唯一的出路。\NMaybe Penguin got himself into a jam and working a deal was his only way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.60,1:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,比例Alada。\NThe Rata Alada.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.89,1:15:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NThe what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.93,1:15:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,振动筛的最新。\NRiddler's latest.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,迷宫中的密码。\NThe cipher in the maze.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.27,1:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是“有翅膀的老鼠”。像个信差。\NIt means "a rat with wings." Like a stool pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.36,1:15:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,企鹅也有翅膀。\NA penguin's got wings too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.99,1:15:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我该再跟他谈谈了。\NTime for me to have another conversation with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.03,1:15:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那谜语人呢?他又要杀人了。\NWhat about the Riddler? He's gonna kill again.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.78,1:15:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是相连的。不管你喜不喜欢，现在是他的游戏了。\NIt's all connected. Like it or not, it's his game now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.08,1:15:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你想找到里德勒，就得找到那只老鼠。\NYou want to find Riddler, we gotta find that rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.87,1:15:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,肯齐和双胞胎，来找你。\NKenzie and the twins, coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.88,1:15:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有企鹅。\NThere's Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.05,1:15:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道袋子里有什么。\NI wonder what's in the bags.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.55,1:15:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你想搬进去吗?\NYou want to move in?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.68,1:15:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们跟随。\NLet's follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.66,1:16:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在海滨街停了下来。回收工厂。\NThey stopped at Waterfront Street. The recycling plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.33,1:16:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里。\NI'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.00,1:16:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-你好吗?-是的,很好。你好吗?\N- How you doing? - Yeah, good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.75,1:16:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好,好。让我们从这洪水中出去。\NGood, good. Let's get in out of this deluge.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.48,1:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个药物实验室。下降。\NIt's a drug lab. Drops.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.10,1:16:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是值得买的。\NThis is a buy.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.40,1:16:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看来他们让马罗尼的行动重新开始了。\NLooks like they got Maroni's operation up and running again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.65,1:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,或者他们根本就没关闭过。\NOr they never shut it down at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.90,1:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?\NWhat are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.86,1:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭市警局史上最大的缉毒行动是一场骗局?\NThe biggest drug bust in GCPD history was a fraud?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.35,1:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这变得复杂了。\NThis just got complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.52,1:17:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思?\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.61,1:17:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!发生了什么事?\NHey! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.15,1:17:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你对吧?\NYou all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.20,1:17:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你在偷危险人群的东西。\NDangerous crowd you're stealing from.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.12,1:17:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.50,1:17:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是这样得到快感的吗，亲爱的?\NIs this how you get your kicks, hon?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.84,1:17:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在黑暗中偷偷接近女孩?\NSneaking up on girls in the dark?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.25,1:17:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才在俱乐部工作吗?\NIs that why you work in the club?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.71,1:17:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切只是个分数?\NIt was all just a score?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.84,1:18:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我很愿意坐下来和你重温每一个血淋淋的细节，蝙蝠小子……但是，那些混蛋又回来了。\NI would love to sit and go over every gory detail with you, bat boy... but, uh, those assholes are coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.23,1:18:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣!\NJesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.80,1:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,复仇!\NHey, Vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.10,1:18:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你能抢走我的钱吗?\NYou think you can come after my money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.68,1:19:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kenzie !得到钱!\NKenzie! Get the money!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.73,1:19:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!什么……\NHey! What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.62,1:20:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,哇!\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.17,1:20:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!来吧!\NCome on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.92,1:20:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙疯了!\NThis guy's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.01,1:20:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!嘿!\NCome on! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.18,1:21:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,动!\NMove!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.00,1:22:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让开!\NGet out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.01,1:22:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧!\NCome on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.81,1:23:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让开!\NGet out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.18,1:23:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你!\NI got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.48,1:23:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你!\NI got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.90,1:23:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着，你这该死的疯子!\NTake that, you friggin' psycho!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.32,1:23:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我有你!\NI got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.23,1:25:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼东西?好警察，坏警察?\NWhat the hell is this? Good cop, batshit cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.15,1:25:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-谁是谜语人?出谜语的人?我怎么知道?\N- Who's the Riddler? - Riddler? How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.86,1:25:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们让你轻松点，奥兹。\NLet's make it easy for you, Oz.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.23,1:25:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,警察发现你在做什么。\NCops caught you doing something.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.74,1:25:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要把你关了，关进监狱。\NThey were gonna shut you down, put you away.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.45,1:25:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你为了自保放弃了一条大鱼。\NSo you gave up a bigger fish to save your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.41,1:25:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你出卖了塞尔瓦托·马罗尼\NYou ratted out Salvatore Maroni.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.62,1:25:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他滴操作。\NHis drops operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.91,1:25:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但是警察，市政府官员，市长，地方检察官，他们都很贪婪，对吧?这还不够，一场能成就事业的大失败。\NBut the cops, the city officials, the mayor, the DA, they got greedy, right? Wasn't enough, a big career-making bust.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.17,1:25:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也想接管毒品交易，但他们需要一个像你这样的小混球来经营。\NThey wanted to take over the drops business too, but they needed a minor league mope like you to run it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.42,1:25:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你不只是为卡迈·法尔肯工作。你也为他们工作。\NYou don't just work for Carmine Falcone. You work for them too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.72,1:25:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?\NWhat are you, crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.97,1:25:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你才杀了那个女孩?\NThat why you killed the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.13,1:25:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我没杀女孩!\NI didn't kill no girl!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.18,1:25:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道她在44层为你工作。\NWe know she worked for you at the 44 Below.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.05,1:25:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但她离得太近了，对吧?\NBut she got too close, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.43,1:25:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,从米奇尔那里得知你是内奸，所以你杀了她。\NFound out from Mitchell that you were the rat, so you killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.72,1:25:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但不知怎么的，里德尔也发现了。\NBut somehow Riddler found out too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.77,1:25:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他很了解你。\NHe knows so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.77,1:25:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-你一定知道他。-他是谁?\N- You must know about him. - Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.40,1:25:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，你们俩的二重唱太棒了。\NBoy, you guys are a hell of a duet here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.03,1:25:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不开始和声呢?\NWhy don't you start harmonizing?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.53,1:25:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小设想只有一个问题，好吗?\NThere's only one problem with your little scenario, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.28,1:25:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是老鼠!\NI ain't no rat!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.70,1:26:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道卡迈·法尔科恩听到这种话会怎么对我吗?\NYou got any idea what Carmine Falcone would do to me if he heard this kind of talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.78,1:26:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想谈老鼠的事吗?\NOh, you don't wanna talk about rats, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.04,1:26:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以谈谈他们对我搭档的脸做了什么。\NMaybe we can talk about what they did to my partner's face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.66,1:26:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊，你在给我看什么?\NHoly God, what are you showing me here?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.29,1:26:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-这是他的头!——加油!\N- This was around his head! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.00,1:26:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,睁开你的眼睛!\NOpen your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.84,1:26:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你是阿拉达吗?\NAre you El Rata Alada?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.51,1:26:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,El装Alada吗?\NEl Rata Alada?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.09,1:26:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，一只“长翅膀的老鼠”。一个诱饵。\NYeah, a "rat with wings." A stool pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.01,1:26:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是你吗?迷宫里的符号，就在这里。\NThat's not you? The symbols in the maze, right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.43,1:26:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,上面说你是阿拉达。\NIt says you are El Rata Alada.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.10,1:26:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"你是El Rata"?它说了吗?\N"You are El Rata"? It says that?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.56,1:26:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，你有事要告诉我们吗?\NWhy, you got something to tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.85,1:26:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊!\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.40,1:26:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我听过最烂的西班牙语了。\NIt's, like, the worst Spanish I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.52,1:26:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.77,1:26:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是“拉”。\NIt's "La."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.19,1:26:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,“拉”系统。\N"La" rata.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.99,1:26:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，这个谜语人傻吗?\NWhat, is this Riddler stupid or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.07,1:26:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣!看看你们俩。\NJesus! Look at you two.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.36,1:26:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的侦探!\NWorld's greatest detectives!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.03,1:26:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,这里只有我一个人知道"el"和"la"的区别吗?\NAm I the only here knows the difference between "el" and "la"?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.41,1:26:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣!\NJesus!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.58,1:26:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没有哈布拉español，伙计们?\NNo habla español, fellas?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.16,1:26:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙，白痴，闭嘴!\NDo me a favor, shithead, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.58,1:26:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他犯了个错误?\NYou think he made a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.75,1:26:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他从不犯错。\NHe doesn't make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.04,1:26:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有翅膀的老鼠?\NA rat with wings?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.17,1:26:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这听起来像什么吗?\NYou know what that sounds like to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.84,1:27:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的蝙蝠!嗯?你想过吗?\NA friggin' bat! Huh? You ever think of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.09,1:27:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,“你是El Rata。”\N"You are El Rata."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.73,1:27:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,“你是埃尔。”\N"You are el."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.28,1:27:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这是个错误。\NMaybe it was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.20,1:27:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他没那么聪明……等待。\NMaybe he isn't as smart as... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.37,1:27:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是他吗?\NIs that him?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.58,1:27:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NHoly shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.31,1:27:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这到底是什么意思?他是还是不是?\NWhat the hell does that mean? Is he or isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.30,1:28:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,“我从小种子长大，像野草一样坚韧。\N"I grew up from a seed, tough as a weed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.01,1:28:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但在豪宅里，在贫民窟里，我永远不知道自己来自哪里。\NBut in a mansion, in a slum, I'll never know where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.73,1:28:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是什么吗?”\NDo you know what I am?"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.14,1:28:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,任何想法?\NAny idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.69,1:28:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.11,1:28:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个孤儿。\NIt's an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.24,1:28:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,贫民窟中的大厦。\NA mansion in a slum.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.54,1:28:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-他说的是老孤儿院。-烧毁的那个?\N- He's talking about the old orphanage. - The one that burned down?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.21,1:28:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是韦恩庄园的一部分。\NIt was part of the Wayne estate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.54,1:28:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他们建好塔后就捐了。\NThey donated it after they built the tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.21,1:28:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧。\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.30,1:29:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道我还在这里吧?\NYou guys realize I'm still here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.80,1:29:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你要给我松绑?\NYou gonna untie me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.26,1:29:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈要怎么离开这里?\NHow the hell am I supposed to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.64,1:29:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.10,1:29:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些狗娘养的!\NYou goddamn sons of bitches!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.62,1:29:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有枪支。\NNo guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.25,1:29:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的,男人。那是你的事。\NYeah, man. That's your thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.40,1:29:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\NWhat's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.12,1:30:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!嘿!\NHey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.50,1:30:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,活动头。\NDropheads.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.13,1:30:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西?\NWhat the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.52,1:30:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你！非常感谢。\NThank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.98,1:30:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很漂亮吗?\NWasn't that beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.03,1:30:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家。谢谢你,嗯…谢谢您今天的光临。\NThank you all. Thank you, uh... Thank you for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.82,1:30:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信高谭市。\NI believe in Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.70,1:30:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信它的承诺。\NI believe in its promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.71,1:31:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,但太多的人被遗忘了太久，这就是我今天在这里的原因。\NBut too many have been left behind for too long, and that's why I'm here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.59,1:31:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不仅要宣布竞选市长，还要宣布成立哥谭复兴基金。\NTo announce, not only my candidacy for mayor, but also the creation of the Gotham Renewal Fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.38,1:31:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,无论输赢，韦恩基金会(Wayne Foundation)承诺捐赠10亿美元，为公共工程启动慈善捐赠。\NWin or lose, the Wayne Foundation pledges a $1 billion donation to start a charitable endowment for public works.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.02,1:31:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我想绕过政治僵局，把钱给现在需要的人和项目，就像我身后的这些孩子。\NI want to bypass political gridlock, and get money to people and projects who need it now, like these children behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.69,1:31:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,“父亲的罪孽。”\N"Sins of the father."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.19,1:31:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,更新是关于成长。它是关于播种的……\NRenewal is about growth. It is about planting seeds...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.12,1:31:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.重申哥谭的承诺。\N...and renewing Gotham's promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.08,1:31:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,将会惩罚他的儿子。\NShall be visited upon the son.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.29,1:31:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。他的下一个受害者是布鲁斯·韦恩。\NJesus. His next victim is Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.01,1:31:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.11,1:32:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,——你好吗?——平底小渔船!我要和阿尔弗雷德说话!\N- Hello? - Dory! I need to speak to Alfred!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.74,1:32:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-韦恩先生…-听我说!\N- Oh, Mr. Wayne... - Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.66,1:32:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的事情就要发生了!\NSomething terrible is gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.95,1:33:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕已经有了，先生。\NI'm afraid it already has, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.84,1:33:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,大约一小时前。\NAbout an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.76,1:33:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉。\NI'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.89,1:33:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在找你。\NI've been trying to reach you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.39,1:33:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这个包裹是为你准备的。\NThe package was intended for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.60,1:33:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是一个寄来的c4炸药。我们也发现了这个。\NIt was a C-4 explosive sent in a mailer. We found this too.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.09,1:33:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拿起他。\NWe've sedated him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.80,1:33:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能希望他稳定下来了。\NWe just have to hope he stabilizes.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.30,1:33:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你该回家了，韦恩先生。得到一些睡眠。\NYou should go home, Mr. Wayne. Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.55,1:34:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他人需要通知吗?\NIs there anyone else to notify?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.64,1:34:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,最亲的亲戚吗?\NNext of kin?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.19,1:34:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不。\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.40,1:34:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是我。\NIt's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.13,1:35:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,塞琳娜?\NSelina?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.01,1:36:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看见我吗?\NCan you see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.14,1:36:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-我能看见你。-我得跟你谈谈。\N- Yeah, I can see you. - I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.44,1:36:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能去哪里?\NWhere can we go?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.21,1:36:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,飞贼又偷东西了?\NCat burglar pulling another score?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.21,1:36:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,——什么?-我不确定还能再见到你。\N- What? - Wasn't sure I'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.75,1:36:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，事情对我来说有点棘手，所以…他们怎么能这样对她?\NYeah, well, things were getting a little hot for me, so... How could they do that to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.72,1:36:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个狗屁警察，肯齐。\NThat piece of shit cop, Kenzie.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.76,1:36:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她的尸体在他的车里。\NHer body was in his car.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.76,1:36:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要找到他，让他付出代价。你要帮我吗?\NI'm gonna find him and I'm gonna make him pay. You gonna help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.72,1:36:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,——帮你吗?-是的。我以为你是"复仇"\N- Help you? - Yeah. I thought you were "Vengeance."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.81,1:36:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友勾搭错了人。\NYour friend got involved with the wrong people.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.44,1:36:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,她也不知道。\NShe didn't know any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.15,1:36:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你应该跟她解释一下。\NMaybe you should have explained it to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.56,1:36:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你这话是什么意思?\NWhat the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.19,1:36:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这意味着你的选择是有后果的。\NIt means your choices have consequences.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.78,1:37:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣基督。“选择”?\NJesus Christ. "Choices"?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.24,1:37:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你是谁，你肯定是富起来的。\NYou know, whoever the hell you are, you obviously grew up rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.03,1:37:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-值得吗?——什么?\N- Was it worth it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.20,1:37:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,为了钱而牺牲自己?\NCompromising yourself for money?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.75,1:37:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么才能得到那笔钱?\NWhat did you have to do to set up that score?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.62,1:37:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你离企鹅有多近?你可以吗?\NHow close did you have to get to Penguin? To Falcone?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.38,1:37:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不知道你在说什么。\NYou don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.80,1:37:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔肯欠我那笔钱。\NFalcone owes me that money.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.21,1:37:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-他欠你的?-是的，还有很多。\N- He owes you? - Yeah, and a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.05,1:37:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,真的吗?为什么?\NOh, really? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.97,1:37:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗?我甚至不能和你说话。\NYou know what? I can't even talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.97,1:37:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不!我想知道为什么像法尔科内这样的人会欠你什么。\NNo! I want to know why a guy like Falcone would owe you anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.89,1:37:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是我父亲!\NBecause he's my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.36,1:37:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲在地下44层工作。\NMy mother worked at the 44 Below.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.65,1:37:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就像安妮一样。\NJust like Anni.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.11,1:37:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我小的时候，她常带我去那里。\NShe used to take me there when I was a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.74,1:37:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,俱乐部吗?\NTo the club?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.00,1:37:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.71,1:38:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她工作的时候我躲在更衣室里。\NI hid out in the dressing room while she worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.05,1:38:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我经常在那里看到他。\NUsed to see him there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.55,1:38:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他吓死我了。\NHe scared the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.51,1:38:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直不明白他为什么那样看我。\NAnd I could never understand why he looked at me the way he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.51,1:38:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一天晚上，我妈妈告诉我他是谁。\NThen one night, my mother told me who he was.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.73,1:38:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我七岁时，我母亲被谋杀了。\NWhen I was seven, my mother was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.73,1:38:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,掐死。\NStrangled.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.65,1:38:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一直没找到是谁。可能是俱乐部里的变态。\NNever found out who. Probably some creep from the club.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.99,1:38:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,总之，社工要把我带走，他什么都没说。\NAnyway, social services came to take me away, and he didn't say a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.16,1:38:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至都不敢看我。\NCouldn't even look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.71,1:38:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他欠我那些钱。\NHe owes me that money.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.26,1:38:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉。\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.80,1:38:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,为我说过的话道歉。\NFor what I said.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.34,1:38:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，没关系。\NOh, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.31,1:38:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你把人往最坏的方面想。\NYou assume the worst in people.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.31,1:38:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,,嗯…\NWhich, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.98,1:39:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们并没有那么不同。\Nmaybe we're not so different after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.36,1:39:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在下面是谁?\NWho are you under there?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.20,1:39:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在隐瞒什么?\NWhat are you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.46,1:39:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是……出奇的伤痕累累?\NAre you just... hideously scarred?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.72,1:39:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.97,1:39:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,听我的。\NListen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.93,1:39:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不为安妮卡挺身而出，没人会。\NIf we don't stand up for Annika, no one will.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.98,1:39:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这里所有人关心的都是这些有特权的白人混蛋。\NAll anyone cares about in this place are these white, privileged assholes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.28,1:39:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,市长，局长，地方检察官。\NThe mayor, the commissioner, the DA.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.45,1:39:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯和布鲁斯·韦恩。\NNow Thomas and Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.78,1:39:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，在我看来，那个疯子有权利去找那些变态。\NI mean, as far as I'm concerned, that psycho's right to go after these creeps.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.24,1:39:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你会站在他那边。\NI think you'd be on his side.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.58,1:39:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"托马斯和布鲁斯·韦恩"是什么意思?\NWhat do you mean, "Thomas and Bruce Wayne"?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.29,1:40:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，你住在山洞里吗?\NWhat, do you live in a cave?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.33,1:40:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,振动筛的最新。这都是关于韦恩一家的。\NThe Riddler's latest. It's all about the Waynes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.50,1:40:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，如果我能找到那个混蛋肯齐，你会帮我吗?\NListen, if I can find that dickbag Kenzie, will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.93,1:40:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,请。\NPlease.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.01,1:40:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,复仇。\NCome on, Vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.39,1:40:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没我在，别轻举妄动，明白吗?\NJust don't make any moves without me, understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.73,1:40:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这比你想象的要危险……\NIt's a little more dangerous than you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.91,1:40:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你，宝贝。\NI told you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.37,1:40:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己。\NI can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.76,1:40:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我是托马斯·韦恩，我同意这条消息。\NI'm Thomas Wayne, and I approve this message.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.89,1:41:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,从很小的时候起，我的家庭，玛莎的家庭，阿卡姆... ...我们都被灌输了回馈社会不仅仅是一种义务，更是一种激情。\NFrom a very young age, my family, Martha's family, the Arkhams... ... instilled in both of us that giving back is not just an obligation, it's a passion.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.40,1:41:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们家族的遗产。\NThat is our family's legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.95,1:41:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩家和阿卡姆家。\NThe Waynes and the Arkhams.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.37,1:41:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭镇成立家庭。\NGotham's founding families.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.91,1:41:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们真正的遗产是什么呢?\NBut what is their real legacy?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.42,1:41:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,20年前，一名记者开始揭露黑暗的真相。\NTwenty years ago, one reporter set out to uncover the dark truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.17,1:41:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他发现了令人震惊的家庭秘密。\NHe found shocking family secrets.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.55,1:41:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么，当玛莎还是个孩子的时候，她的母亲残忍地谋杀了她的父亲，然后自杀了... ...以及阿卡姆家族如何利用他们的权力和金钱来掩盖真相。\NHow, when Martha was just a child, her mother brutally murdered her father, then committed suicide... ...and how the Arkhams used their power and money to cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.14,1:41:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎自己是如何进出机构多年而他们不想让任何人知道。\NHow Martha herself was in and out of institutions for years and they didn't want anyone to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.11,1:41:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯·韦恩试图强迫这个激进的记者签订保密协议来拯救他的市长竞选。\NThomas Wayne tried to force this crusading reporter into a hush-money agreement to save his mayoral campaign.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.74,1:42:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但当记者拒绝... ...韦恩求助于长期的秘密同伙卡迈·法尔科内并谋杀了他!\NBut when the reporter refused... ... Wayne turned to longtime secret associate Carmine Falcone and had him murdered!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.38,1:42:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩一家和阿卡姆一家，高谭市谎言和谋杀的遗产。\NThe Waynes and the Arkhams, Gotham's legacy of lies and murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.76,1:42:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你在听，布鲁斯·韦恩。\NI hope you're listening, Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.22,1:42:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是你的遗产。\NThis is your legacy too.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.68,1:42:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,高谭市需要你为你父亲的罪行负责。\NAnd Gotham needs you to answer for the sins of your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.57,1:42:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再见。\NGoodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.16,1:42:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗?\NDo you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.87,1:42:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你是布鲁斯·韦恩。\NYou're Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.08,1:42:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我要见卡迈·福肯。\NI wanna see Carmine Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.71,1:42:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗?\NSee?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.02,1:43:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个发明球的人是谁，对吧?\NWho is this guy who invented the ball, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.40,1:43:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是赚了一大笔。\NMust have made a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.98,1:43:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你思考一下，它的概念，对吧?\NIf you think about it, the concept of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.24,1:43:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,布里斯科，你知道这件毛衣多少钱吗?\NBriscoe, do you know how much this sweater cost?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.78,1:43:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不,老板。\NNo, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.87,1:43:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,1183美元。\N$1,183.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.78,1:43:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道共产主义失败的原因吧?\NYou know why communism failed, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.83,1:43:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不,老板。\NNo, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.75,1:43:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,紧缩政策。\NAusterity.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.25,1:43:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧。好吧。\NAll right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.17,1:43:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个。完美的。\NLook at that. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.63,1:43:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不会那么好了。\NIt's never gonna be that good again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.59,1:43:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,约翰尼浮油。\NHey, Johnny Slick.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.18,1:43:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么?\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.27,1:43:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我们点时间，伙计们。\NGive us a moment here, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.02,1:43:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧。\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.98,1:43:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再见,冠军。\NSee ya, champ.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.19,1:43:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,甜心。\NCome on, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.40,1:43:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个座位。\NHave a seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.45,1:44:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想可能会有你的消息。\NI thought I might hear from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.41,1:44:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个，呃，狗娘养的里德尔真的…挑起事端，是吧?\NThis, uh, Riddler son of a bitch is really... stirring things up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.96,1:44:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-是真的吗?——什么?\N- Is it true? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.96,1:44:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,记者业务吗?\NThat reporter business?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.92,1:44:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你想知道什么，孩子?\NWhat do you want to know here, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.21,1:44:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是你杀了他吗?为我的父亲吗?\NDid you kill him? For my father?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.09,1:44:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,听着，你父亲有麻烦了。\NLook, your father was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.72,1:44:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这位记者掌握了一些内幕。\NThis reporter had some dirt.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.60,1:44:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一些非常…关于你母亲的私人信息，她的家族史。\NSome very... personal stuff about your mother, her family history.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.23,1:44:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都有不可告人的秘密，就是这样。\NEverybody's got their dirty laundry, that's just how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.02,1:44:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不想让任何消息传出去，尤其是在大选之前。\NBut he didn't want none of it coming out, not right before the election.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.94,1:44:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲想收买那个人，但他不同意。\NAnd your father tried to pay the guy off, but he wasn't going for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.03,1:44:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以，他来找我。\NSo, he came to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.28,1:44:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过他那样。\NWell, I never seen him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.50,1:44:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他说，卡迈恩，我要你让这家伙感到害怕\NHe said, "Carmine, I want you to put the fear of God in this guy."
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.26,1:45:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,当恐惧还不够的时候……现钞。嗯。\NAnd when fear isn't enough... Oof. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.01,1:45:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲希望我来处理，所以我来了。\NYour father wanted me to handle it, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.35,1:45:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我处理它。\NI handled it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.89,1:45:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道。\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.40,1:45:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你父亲是童子军。\NYou thought your father was a Boy Scout.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.90,1:45:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但你会惊讶于即使是像他这样的好人在合适的情况下也能做出什么。\NBut you'd be surprised what even a good man like him is capable of in the right situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.12,1:45:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙。\NDo me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.91,1:45:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不要为这件事担心。\NDon't lose any sleep over it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.66,1:45:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个记者是个卑鄙小人。\NThis reporter was a lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.75,1:45:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他受雇于马罗尼。\NHe was on Maroni's payroll.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.84,1:45:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-马罗尼?-哦,是的。\N- Maroni? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.21,1:45:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他绝对受不了你父亲和我有过节。\NHe could never stand your father and I had history.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.89,1:45:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,在那个记者出事之后，马罗尼担心你父亲会永远被我玩弄于股掌之间。\NAnd after what happened with that reporter, Maroni was worried that your father would be in my pocket, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.23,1:45:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他会不惜一切代价阻止他当上市长。\NHe would have done anything to keep him from becoming mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.61,1:46:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗?\NYou understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.15,1:46:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说塞尔瓦托·马罗尼害死了我父亲?\NAre you saying Salvatore Maroni got my father killed?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.78,1:46:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这是真的吗?\NDo I know it for a fact?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.24,1:46:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是说，在我看来确实是这样。\NI'm just saying, it sure looked that way to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.71,1:46:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你想要的，对吧?\NThis is what you wanted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.08,1:46:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这段对话?\NThis little conversation here?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.92,1:46:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没见了，是吧?\NIt's been a long time coming, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.72,1:46:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，你不再是个孩子了。\NI mean, you ain't a kid no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.25,1:47:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗了我…\NYou lied to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.38,1:47:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我的整个生活。\Nmy whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.18,1:47:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我和卡迈·法尔科内谈过了。\NI spoke to Carmine Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.31,1:47:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉我他为我父亲做了什么。\NHe told me what he did for my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.60,1:48:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,关于萨尔瓦多·马罗尼。\NAbout Salvatore Maroni.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.11,1:48:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉你塞尔瓦托·马罗尼杀了我父亲。\NHe told you Salvatore Maroni... Had my father killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.11,1:48:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我这些?\NWhy didn't you tell me all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.08,1:48:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这些年来我一直在为他争取，相信他是个好人。\NAll these years I've spent fighting for him, believing that he was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.13,1:48:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人。\NHe was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.88,1:48:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你听我说。\NYou listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.67,1:48:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲是个好人。\NYour father was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.72,1:48:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-他犯了个错误。——一个“错误”。\N- He made a mistake. - A "mistake."
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.72,1:48:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他杀了一个人。\NHe had a man killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.73,1:48:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.98,1:48:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护他的家庭形象?\NTo protect his family image?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.32,1:48:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他的政治抱负?\NHis political aspirations?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.65,1:48:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是为了保护家族形象，他也没杀任何人。\NIt wasn't to protect the family image, and he didn't have anyone killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.78,1:48:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他在保护你母亲。\NHe was protecting your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.28,1:48:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他不关心自己的形象，也不关心竞选，什么都不关心。\NHe didn't care about his image or the campaign, any of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.91,1:49:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他关心她，也关心你，在一时软弱的时候，他求助于法尔科恩。\NHe cared about her, and you, and in a moment of weakness, he turned to Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.50,1:49:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但他没想到法尔科内会杀了那个人。\NBut he never thought Falcone would kill that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.84,1:49:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲应该知道法尔科内会不惜一切来抓住他的把柄。\NYour father should have known that Falcone would do anything to finally have something on him that he could use.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.47,1:49:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是法尔科内。\NThat's who Falcone is.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.56,1:49:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你父亲的错误。\NAnd that was your father's mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.85,1:49:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但当法尔科内告诉他他做了什么时，你父亲气疯了。\NBut when Falcone told him what he'd done, your father was distraught.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.61,1:49:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他告诉法尔科内他要去警察局，他会坦白一切。\NHe told Falcone he was going to the police, that he would confess everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.57,1:49:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那晚，你的父母被杀了。\NAnd that night, your father and your mother were killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.09,1:49:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你可以吗?\NIt was Falcone?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.89,1:49:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我能确定。\NOh, I wish I knew for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.73,1:50:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是街上某个随便的暴徒需要钱，害怕了，开得太快了。\NOr maybe it was some random thug on the street who needed money, got scared, and pulled the trigger too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.19,1:50:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不认为我每天都在寻找答案…保护他们是我的职责。你明白吗?\NIf you don't think I've spent every day searching for that answer... It was my job to protect them. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.70,1:50:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你总是责怪自己。\NI know you always blamed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.58,1:50:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你那时还只是个孩子，布鲁斯。\NYou were only a boy, Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.29,1:50:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我能看到你眼中的恐惧，但我不知道该怎么帮你。\NI could see the fear in your eyes, but I didn't know how to help.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.46,1:50:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以教你如何战斗，但我没有能力照顾你。\NI could teach you how to fight, but I wasn't equipped to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.10,1:50:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要一个父亲。\NYou needed a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.89,1:50:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而你拥有的只有我。\NAnd all you had was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.69,1:50:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉。\NI'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.65,1:50:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,别难过，阿尔弗雷德。\NDon't be sorry, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.37,1:51:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,神。\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.50,1:51:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过我会再感受到那样的恐惧。\NI never thought I'd feel fear like that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.63,1:51:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我已经掌握了所有这些。\NI thought I'd mastered all that.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.18,1:51:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，我不怕死。\NI mean, I'm not afraid to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.52,1:51:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在意识到有些事我没有过去。\NI realize now there's something I haven't got past.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.82,1:51:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这种恐惧……\NThis fear...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.03,1:51:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不会经历那种事了。\Nof ever going through any of that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.24,1:51:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,失去一个我在乎的人。\NOf losing somebody I care about.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.05,1:52:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿。\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.09,1:52:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到信号了。那不是你吗?\NI saw the signal. That's not you?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.93,1:52:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为是你。\NI thought it was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.77,1:52:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-我找到他了!-我看到了。\N- I found him! - I see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.40,1:52:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他拿了我的东西和手机。\NHe had my shit and my phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.98,1:53:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他们带走她的那晚，她留了言。\NShe left a message the night they took her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.28,1:53:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,她叫我…戈登!帮帮我，伙计!\NShe called me... Gordon! Help me out, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.07,1:53:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,她拿了我的枪!\NShe got my gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.70,1:53:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- - - - - -闭嘴!-把枪放下\N- Shut up! - Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.95,1:53:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你，该死的!她给我打电话!\NI'm telling you, God damn it! She called me!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.09,1:53:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里。听。\NHere. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.13,1:53:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!回到这里!\NHey! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.92,1:53:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里?回来这里!\NWhere you going? Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.18,1:53:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，嘿，你在干什么，肯齐?\NHey, hey, what are you doing, Kenzie?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.35,1:53:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你吓到她。\NYou're scaring her.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.76,1:53:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，法尔科内先生。\NI'm sorry, Mr. Falcone.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.56,1:53:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请,请,请。\NPlease, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.68,1:53:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了，别伤害我。\NPlease, don't hurt me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.06,1:53:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，别害怕。到这里来。\NHey, don't be scared. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.61,1:53:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让我再问你一次。\NNow let me ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.36,1:53:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-米奇尔怎么跟你说的——不,什么都没有。他……唐喜欢说话。我知道。\N- What did Mitchell tell you? - No, nothing. He... Don liked to talk. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.99,1:53:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是像你这样漂亮的女孩。\NEspecially to pretty girls like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.24,1:53:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我让他拿走了你的护照直到我们能好好谈谈。\NThat's why I made him take your passport... until we could have this little conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.91,1:53:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想离开这里，好吗?\NAll I want to do is get out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.71,1:54:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会再听到我的消息，没人会。请,请……我们会救你出去的，我保证。\NYou'll never hear from me again, nobody will. Please, please... We're gonna get you out of here, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.88,1:54:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先，我得知道…他跟你说了什么?\NBut first, I gotta know... What did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.64,1:54:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是说他们都和你做了交易。\NHe just said they all made a deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.68,1:54:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦。嗯。\NOh. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.98,1:54:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟你说了吧?\NHe told you about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.02,1:54:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这笔交易。\NThe deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.40,1:54:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你给了他一些情报他就是这样当上市长的。\NHe said you gave some information on some drops thing and that's how he became mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.20,1:54:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你是个很重要的人。\NHe said you were a very important man.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.66,1:54:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的。\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.53,1:54:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼。\NMm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.87,1:54:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯。好吧。\NHmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.71,1:54:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,放松点。\NJust take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.13,1:54:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，他要勒死她了。\NJesus, he's strangling her.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.76,1:54:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要着急。\NTake it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.02,1:54:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,装Alada。\NRata Alada.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.07,1:55:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,猎鹰也有翅膀。\NA falcon has wings too.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.19,1:55:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔肯是老鼠?\NFalcone is the rat?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.00,1:55:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔肯为你们工作?\NFalcone works for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.84,1:55:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,市长吗?哒?\NThe mayor? The DA?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.38,1:55:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不。\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.55,1:55:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为他工作。\NWe work for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.85,1:55:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都一样。\NEverybody does.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.18,1:55:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如何?\NHow?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.27,1:55:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,通过更新。\NThrough Renewal.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.64,1:55:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,更新就是一切。\NRenewal is everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.10,1:55:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-复兴基金?-是的。\N- The Renewal Fund? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.02,1:55:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,托马斯·韦恩死后，他们都像秃鹰一样追逐它。\NAfter Thomas Wayne died, they all went after it like vultures.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.82,1:55:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,市长，法尔肯，马罗尼。每个人都参与其中。\NThe mayor, Falcone, Maroni. Everyone got in on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.49,1:55:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很适合行贿，洗黑钱。\NIt was perfect for making bribes, laundering money.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.95,1:55:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一个没有监管的大型慈善基金。\NA huge charitable fund with no oversight.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.12,1:55:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都分到一块。\NEverybody got a piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.91,1:55:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是法尔科内想要更多。\NBut Falcone wanted more.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.54,1:56:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他精心策划了一出戏来扳倒马罗尼。\NSo he orchestrated a play to take Maroni down big.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.17,1:56:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他会揭发他的秘密行动，让所有追杀他的人都成为他的傀儡。\NHe'd rat out his drops operation, make the careers of everybody that went after him, then install them all as his puppets.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.22,1:56:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这该死的选举重要吗?\NYou think this goddamn election matters?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.39,1:56:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要求的市长。\NFalcone's the mayor.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.27,1:56:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他当了20年的市长。\NHe's been the mayor for the last 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.86,1:56:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧,复仇。\NCome on, Vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.94,1:56:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去杀了那个混蛋。\NLet's go kill that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.49,1:56:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-这家伙也是。让我们完成这个。-哦,上帝!\N- This creep too. Let's finish this. - Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.20,1:56:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.49,1:56:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会得到他。\NWe'll get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.37,1:56:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-但不是那样。-没有别的办法了!\N- But not that way. - There is no other way!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.33,1:56:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他拥有这座城市!\NHe owns the city!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.54,1:56:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,跨越这条线…你会变得像他一样。\NCross that line... you'll become just like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.58,1:56:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听我的。\NListen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.21,1:56:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不要放弃你的生活。\NDon't throw your life away.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.63,1:56:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心,亲爱的。\NDon't worry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.10,1:56:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我有九个。\NI got nine of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.68,1:56:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不,不!嘿,嘿!\NNo, don't! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.93,1:57:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,上帝!\NOh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.53,1:57:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,她不会活着出来的。\NShe won't get out of there alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.82,1:57:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她杀了法尔科内，我们可能就永远找不到谜语人了。\NAnd if she kills Falcone, we may never find the Riddler.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.49,1:57:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须阻止她。\NI have to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.66,1:57:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说“我们”吗?\NDon't you mean "we"?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.95,1:57:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我得按我的方式来。\NI gotta do this my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.83,1:57:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢?\NAnd then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.71,1:57:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们照Riddler说的做。\NWe do what Riddler said.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.92,1:57:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把老鼠带到阳光下。\NBring the rat into the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.50,1:58:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你能告诉法尔科内先生我要上去吗?\NCan you tell Mr. Falcone I'd like to come up?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.62,1:58:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他今晚谁也不见了。\NHe ain't seein' nobody tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.71,1:58:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他是关于安妮卡的。\NTell him it's about Annika.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.30,1:58:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.47,1:58:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这是谁啊?\NLook who it is, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.97,1:58:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉打扰你。——不。它很好,很漂亮。\N- Sorry to bother you. - Nah. It's fine, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.47,1:58:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想和你说几句话?\NI was just hoping I could talk to you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.64,1:58:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对的。\NAbsolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.85,1:58:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,独自一人吗?\NAlone?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.41,1:58:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.05,1:58:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我太担心了。\NI'm just so worried.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.34,1:58:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道她在哪里。\NI don't know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.72,1:58:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是个很重要的人。\NAnd I know that you're a very important man.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.18,1:59:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能帮我找到她因为她离开太久了，我开始…我很抱歉。\NI was hoping that maybe you could help me find her... because she's been gone so long, I'm beginning to... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.27,1:59:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系。\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.44,1:59:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-对不起。——我明白了。在这里。\N- I'm so sorry. - I understand. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.73,1:59:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了，我有纸巾。\NNo, that's okay, I have a tissue.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.87,1:59:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,要求先生吗?\NMr. Falcone?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.87,1:59:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,维尼!我没告诉过你吗?\NVinnie! Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.41,1:59:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，法尔科内先生。我觉得你会想看看这个。\NI'm sorry, Mr. Falcone. I really think you're gonna want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.71,1:59:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起,漂亮。\NI'm sorry, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.29,1:59:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我马上就回来。\NI'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.02,1:59:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NHoly shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.18,1:59:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那段录音，由哥谭警局的詹姆斯·戈登警督提供给GC-1。\NThat recording, provided to GC-1 by Lieutenant James Gordon of the Gotham PD.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.73,1:59:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要提醒大家，内容非常生动，可能会让你们有些人感到不安。\NAnd we should warn you, the contents are extremely graphic and some of you may find it disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.49,2:00:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是说他们都和你做了交易。\NHe just said they all made a deal with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.12,2:00:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦。嗯。\NOh. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.83,2:00:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他跟你说了吧?\NHe told you about that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.58,2:00:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这笔交易。\NThe deal.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.16,2:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你给了他一些情报他就是这样当上市长的。\NHe said you gave some information on some drops thing and that's how he became mayor.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.04,2:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你是个很重要的人。\NHe said you were a very important man.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.67,2:00:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的。\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:18.55,2:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯。\NHmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.84,2:00:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧。\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.31,2:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔科内作为黑手党线人的秘密角色被揭露嗨,爸爸。\NRevelations of Mr. Falcone's secret role as a mafia informant... Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.90,2:00:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.36,2:00:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我是玛丽亚·凯尔的孩子。\NI'm Maria Kyle's kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.03,2:00:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得她吗?\NYou remember her?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.53,2:00:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.87,2:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪放下，亲爱的。\NJust put down the gun, honey.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.04,2:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这是给我妈妈的。\NThis is for my mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.39,2:01:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到他!\NI see him!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.60,2:02:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这会伤害我吗?\NYou don't think this hurts me?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.94,2:02:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的亲骨肉?\NMy own flesh and blood, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.63,2:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是你逼我这么做的。\NYou made me do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.88,2:03:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就像你妈妈一样。\NJust like your mother.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:09.68,2:03:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须付出代价!\NHe has to pay!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.93,2:03:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用向他付钱。\NYou don't have to pay with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.69,2:03:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你花了足够了。\NYou paid enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.77,2:03:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.98,2:03:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你，伙计。你觉得这是什么?\NLook at you, man. What do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.77,2:04:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你的面具和斗篷能吓到我吗?\NYou think you're gonna scare me with that mask and that cape?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.94,2:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我会开始哭，然后突然之间，什么大秘密就泄露了?\NI'm gonna start crying, and all of a sudden, some big secret's comin' out?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.86,2:04:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你。\NLet me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.57,2:04:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我知道什么，做过什么，都将随我入土。\NWhatever I know, whatever I've done, it's all going with me to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.21,2:04:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你和佐罗在一起吗?\NWhat, are you with Zorro over here?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.80,2:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不知道你们这些穿蓝衣服的小子是为我工作的吗?\NDon't you know you boys in blue work for me?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.02,2:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我想不是所有人都为你工作。\NI guess we don't all work for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.36,2:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有权保持沉默。\NYou have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.74,2:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你所说的一切都将成为呈堂证供。\NAnything you say can and will be used against you in a court of law.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.33,2:04:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你有权请律师。\NYou have the right to an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.75,2:05:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你买不起，哥谭市会为你提供。\NIf you cannot afford one, the City of Gotham will provide one to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.88,2:05:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解这些权利吗?\NDo you understand these rights?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.09,2:05:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白吗?\NDo you understand?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.63,2:05:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.80,2:05:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我出去的时候再见你。\NI'll see you when I walk out.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.97,2:05:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,考虑到这些权利，你还有什么想说的吗……该死的老鼠。\NWith these rights in mind, is there anything else you wish to tell... Goddamn rat.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:18.64,2:05:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你想说什么?\NWhat'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.06,2:05:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你在黑门过得愉快，卡迈恩。\NEnjoy your night at Blackgate, Carmine.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.94,2:05:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是你最后一次了。\NProbably be your last.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.44,2:05:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哇咔。所以你现在是个大男人了，奥兹?\NOh-ho. So you're a big man now, Oz?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.57,2:05:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我。\NMaybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.73,2:05:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,真的,奥兹?\NReally, Oz?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.03,2:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,因为对我来说，你一直只是个穿着空西装的瘸子。\NBecause to me, you were always just a gimp in an empty suit.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.82,2:05:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我要给你屁股喷漆!\NI'll spray paint your ass!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.00,2:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?这不是我!\NWhat are you doing? It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.54,2:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有开枪!我没有开枪!\NI didn't shoot! I didn't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.88,2:05:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我!\NGet your hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.90,2:06:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,“把他带到光里去。\N"Bring him into the light.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.49,2:06:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你会知道我在什么地方的。”\NAnd you'll find where I'm at."
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.53,2:06:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里!\NThere!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.70,2:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,子弹是从上面射过来的!\NThe shots came from up there!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.12,2:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,出谜语的人。\NIt's Riddler.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.20,2:06:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,计,在我身上。\NGage, on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.46,2:06:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁内斯,左右回来。没人能进去，没人能出来!\NMartinez, around back. Nobody gets in there, nobody gets out!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.37,2:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了。\NHe's gone.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:50.38,2:07:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直都在这里。\NHe's been here this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.42,2:07:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,——中尉。马丁内斯。——是吗?\N- Lieutenant. Martinez. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.84,2:07:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,副队，我们有目击证人，说她看到有人在枪击发生后从防火梯下来。\NLieutenant, we got a witness here, says she saw someone coming down the fire escape right after the shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.80,2:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,她说他去了街角的餐厅。\NShe said he went into the corner diner.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.35,2:08:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙现在一个人坐在柜台边。\NThe guy's sitting by himself at the counter, right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.78,2:08:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,警察!举起手来!\NPolice! Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.91,2:08:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他说把手举起来，你个混蛋。\NHe said put your goddamn hands up, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.56,2:08:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚点了一块南瓜派。\NI just ordered a slice of pumpkin pie.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:52.44,2:08:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,呆着别动!\NStay still!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.81,2:08:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在!\NNow!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.47,2:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一个是你?\NWhich one is you?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.35,2:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我。\NYou tell me.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.68,2:09:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧,pencil-neck。\NLet's go, pencil-neck.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.23,2:09:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把那狗娘养的带出去!\NGet that son of a bitch out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.49,2:09:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.甚至谋杀了市长小唐·米切尔他的妻子和儿子聚集在一起，表现出城市团结。\N...where even murdered mayor Don Mitchell, Jr. 's wife and son have gathered in an emotional show of city unity.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.17,2:09:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请听丹·奥尼尔为您从Reál总部发回的现场报道。嘿。\NOur Dan O'Neil is live inside Reál's headquarters right now... Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:22.32,2:10:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这些日记是怎么回事?\NWhat are all these diaries?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.11,2:10:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的帐。他有成千上万的人。\NThey're ledgers. He's got thousands.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.62,2:10:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他在上面乱涂乱画，密文，暗号。\NHe scrawled all over 'em. Rambling, ciphers, codes.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.24,2:10:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个身份有线索了。\NGot something back on one of the IDs.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.87,2:10:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华Nashton。在KTMJ工作。\NEdward Nashton. Works at KTMJ.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.25,2:10:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-他是法务会计师。——会计?\N- He's a forensic accountant. - Accountant?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.17,2:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,中尉!你真的不介意吗?\NHey, Lieutenant! You really okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.67,2:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那证据链呢?\NWhat about chain of evidence?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:41.26,2:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该看看这个。\NYou should see this.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.43,2:10:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他戴手套。\NHe's wearing gloves.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.39,2:10:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,“星期五,7月16日。\N"Friday, July 16th.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.73,2:11:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的生活一直是一个我无法解开的残酷的谜，窒息着我的心灵，无处可逃。\NMy life has been a cruel riddle I could not solve, suffocating my mind, no escape.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.90,2:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是，今天，我看到了。\NBut then, today, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.40,2:11:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这账簿上的一个字，就放在我旁边的桌子上。\NA single word on this ledger, sitting on the desk beside me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.87,2:11:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,“更新”。\N'Renewal.'
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.74,2:11:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候在孤儿院时他们给我的空头承诺。\NThe empty promise they sold to me as a child in that orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.25,2:11:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,看了一眼里面，我终于明白了。\NOne look inside, and finally I understood.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.46,2:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在为这事做准备。\NMy whole life has been preparing me for this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.88,2:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道真相的时刻。\NThe moment when I would learn the truth.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.42,2:11:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当我终于可以反击，揭穿他们的谎言时。”\NWhen I could finally strike back and expose their lies."
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.55,2:11:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,“如果你想让人们理解，真正理解，你不能只是给他们答案。\N"If you want people to understand, really understand, you can't just give them the answers.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.77,2:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须面对他们，用可怕的问题折磨他们，就像他们折磨我一样。\NYou have to confront them, torture them with the horrifying questions, just like they tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.06,2:11:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在知道我必须成为什么了。”\NI know now what I must become."
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.82,2:11:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.24,2:11:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那只老鼠不喜欢你，伙计。\NI don't think that rat likes you, man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.75,2:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是一只老鼠。\NThis one's not a rat.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.89,2:12:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\NWhat is that?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:46.63,2:12:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,某种撬撬工具?\NSome kind of pry tool?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:47.92,2:12:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是凿子吗?\NIs it a chisel?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.38,2:12:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是凶器。\NIt's a murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.93,2:12:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他用它杀了米奇尔。\NHe killed Mitchell with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.97,2:12:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,边缘与市长书房的地板印痕吻合。\NThe edge will match the floorboard impression in the mayor's study.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:04.44,2:13:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,“我坦白”?\N"My confession"?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:06.53,2:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他在忏悔什么?他已经告诉我们他杀了米奇尔。\NWhat's he confessing to? He already told us he killed Mitchell.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.49,2:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是结束。\NThis isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.95,2:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哦,男人。他在网上发布各种各样的屁话。\NOh, man. He's been posting all kinds of shit online.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.78,2:13:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他大概有500个粉丝。真正的边缘类型。\NHe's got, like, 500 followers. Real fringe types.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.09,2:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他最后一次发邮件是昨晚。\NHis final post was last night.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.38,2:13:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一些视频。浏览量很大，但有密码保护。\NSome video. Got a lot of views, but it's password-protected.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.67,2:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能进去吗?-正在复制他的硬盘。\N- Can you get in? - Copying his drive now.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.80,2:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,花点时间，但我们会进去的。\NTake some time, but we'll get in.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.57,2:13:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-给我看看邮筒。-就在这儿。\N- Show me the post. - It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.74,2:13:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,“真相揭露了。”\N"The Truth Unmasked."
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.28,2:13:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我是他最后一个目标。\NI think I'm his last target.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.49,2:13:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你吗?\NYou?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.95,2:14:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这一切都要结束了。\NMaybe this is all coming to an end.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.54,2:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么?\NWhat is?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.38,2:14:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠。\NThe Batman.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.17,2:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.64,2:14:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的。\NRight.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.73,2:14:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,谜语人在找你。在雅克罕姆。\NRiddler's asking for you. At Arkham.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.16,2:14:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好警察。\NYou're a good cop.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.27,2:15:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过会下地狱见你的。\NI told you I'd see you in hell.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.40,2:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你想从我这里得到什么?\NWhat do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.32,2:15:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“想要”?\N"Want"?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.44,2:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是知道我等这一天等了多久就好了。\NIf only you knew how long I've been waiting for this day.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.28,2:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为这一刻。\NFor this moment.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.66,2:15:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都是隐形人。\NI've been invisible my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.75,2:15:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我不会再是了，对吧?\NI guess I won't be anymore, will I?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.92,2:15:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在会记住我的。\NThey'll remember me now.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.42,2:15:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会记住我们俩的。\NThey'll remember both of us.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.64,2:15:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯……\NBruce...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:47.48,2:15:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩。\NWayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.69,2:15:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯……韦恩。\NBruce... Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.00,2:16:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗，那天我也在场。\NYou know, I was there that day.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.01,2:16:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的托马斯·韦恩宣布竞选市长的那天，许下了所有这些承诺。\NThe day the great Thomas Wayne announced he was running for mayor, made all those promises.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.31,2:16:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,一周后他就死了，所有人都把我们忘了。\NWell, a week later he was dead, and everybody just forgot about us.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.10,2:16:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们聊的都是可怜的布鲁斯·韦恩。\NAll they could talk about was poor Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.73,2:16:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩，孤儿。\NBruce Wayne, the orphan.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.99,2:16:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,孤儿。\NOrphan.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.20,2:16:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,住在公园里的高塔里可不是孤儿。\NLiving in some tower over the park isn't being an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.62,2:16:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看不起所有人，有那么多钱。\NLooking down on everyone, with all that money.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.92,2:16:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别告诉我。\NDon't you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.09,2:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么是孤儿吗?\NDo you know what being an orphan is?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.14,2:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,30个孩子住一个房间。\NIt's 30 kids to a room.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.02,2:17:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,才十二岁，就已经是软脑瘤了，疼痛已经麻木了。\NTwelve years old and already a drophead, numbing the pain.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:12.77,2:17:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你尖叫着醒来，老鼠在咬你的手指。\NYou wake up screaming with rats chewing your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:18.61,2:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,每年冬天都有一个婴儿因为太冷而死去。\NAnd every winter one of the babies die because it's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:25.45,2:17:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但是,哦,不。\NBut, oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:30.96,2:17:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来谈谈那个爸爸死了，满嘴谎言的亿万富翁吧因为至少有了钱，事情就容易解决了。\NLet's talk about the billionaire with the lying, dead daddy because at least the money makes it go down easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.21,2:17:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗?\NDoesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.67,2:17:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯……韦恩。\NBruce... Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.35,2:17:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我们唯一没抓到的人。\NHe's the only one we didn't get.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.86,2:17:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但剩下的我们都抓到了，不是吗?\NBut we got the rest of 'em, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.44,2:18:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那些滑头，卑鄙，虚伪的混蛋。\NAll those slick, sleazy, phony pricks.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.49,2:18:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,神。\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:08.66,2:18:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你。\NLook at you.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:11.62,2:18:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你的面具太棒了。\NYour mask is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:14.17,2:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望你能看到我穿的。\NI wish you could've seen me in mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.17,2:18:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不是搞笑吗?\NAin't it funny?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.34,2:18:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人都想揭开你的面具，但他们没有抓住重点。\NAll everyone wants to do is unmask you, but they're missing the point.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.22,2:18:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你我都知道我现在看到的是真实的你。\NYou and I both know I'm looking at the real you right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.81,2:18:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的面具让我完全做我自己。\NMy mask allowed me to be myself completely.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.52,2:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,没有羞耻，没有限制。\NNo shame, no limits.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:37.06,2:18:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要给我写信?\NWhy did you write me?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.61,2:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思?\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:40.69,2:18:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所有这些卡片。\NAll those cards.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.49,2:18:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你，我们一直在一起。你是其中一员。\NI told you, we've been doing this together. You're a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:46.41,2:18:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们什么都没一起做——我们所做的。\N- We didn't do anything together. - We did.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.70,2:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚才做了什么?\NWhat did we just do?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:50.24,2:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你把他带进光明，你照做了。\NI asked you to bring him into the light, and you did.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.33,2:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一个很好的团队。\NWe're such a good team.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.58,2:18:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是一个团队。\NWe're not a team.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.67,2:18:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不可能把他救出来。\NI never could have gotten him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:57.25,2:18:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是身体。我的力量在这里。\NI'm not physical. My strength is up here.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.75,2:19:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说，我有所有的线索，我有答案。\NI mean, I had all the pieces, I had the answers.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.01,2:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不知道如何让他们倾听。\NBut I didn't know how to make them listen.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.72,2:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是你给我的。\NYou gave me that.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.01,2:19:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没给你。\NI gave you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.22,2:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉了我什么是可能的。\NYou showed me what was possible.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.89,2:19:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我看到了恐惧和一点点暴力。\NYou showed me all it takes is fear and a little focused violence.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.85,2:19:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你启发了我。\NYou inspired me.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:16.48,2:19:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的疯了。\NYou're out of your goddamn mind.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:19.11,2:19:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.27,2:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是你的想法。你生病了,有点扭。\NThis is all in your head. You're sick, twisted.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.53,2:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说?\NHow can you say that?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.99,2:19:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你会被记住吗?\NYou think you'll be remembered?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.57,2:19:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个可悲的疯子，在乞求别人的关注。——没有。\NYou're a pathetic psychopath, - begging for attention. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.58,2:19:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-你会在阿卡姆孤独终老。——没有。\N- You're gonna die alone in Arkham. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.33,2:19:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不,不!\NNo, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.45,2:19:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人!\NA nobody!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:35.16,2:19:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.88,2:19:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\NAhhh!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.50,2:19:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,事情不该是这样发展的!\NThis is not how this was supposed to go!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.05,2:19:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊!\NAhhh!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.76,2:19:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我都计划好了!\NI had it all planned out!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.39,2:19:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里会很安全。\NWe were gonna be safe here.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.77,2:19:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起看整部电影。\NWe could watch the whole thing together.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.15,2:19:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么?\NWatch what?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.23,2:20:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一切!\NEverything!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.32,2:20:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都在那里。\NIt was all there.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.16,2:20:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说，你没发现吗?\NYou mean, you didn't figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.79,2:20:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的没有我想的那么聪明。\NOh, you're really not as smart as I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.76,2:20:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我太相信你了。\NI guess I gave you too much credit.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.30,2:20:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么?\NWhat have you done?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.26,2:20:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,什么东西遍体鳞伤，满目疮痍?\NWhat's black and blue and dead all over?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.98,2:20:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你。\NYou.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.48,2:20:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你认为你能阻止即将发生的事…你做了什么?\NIf you think you can stop what's coming... What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.03,2:20:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,万福玛利亚你做了什么?\NAve Maria What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.62,2:21:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什么?\NGratia plena What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.59,2:21:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚例如满\NMaria Gratia plena
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.55,2:21:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.92,2:21:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么?\NWhat are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:08.15,2:22:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计，我觉得你不该碰那个。\NHey, man, I don't think that you should be touching that.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.33,2:22:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊，这家伙真是个疯子?\NBoy, this guy's a real nutjob, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.66,2:22:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,用该死的地毯工具杀了米切尔。\NKilling Mitchell with a friggin' carpet tool.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:28.09,2:22:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我的叔叔是一个…他是一个安装程序。\NMy uncle's a... He's an installer.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.22,2:22:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，这是…哦,你知道的。\NYou know, it's a... Oh, you know.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.47,2:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个塔克。\NIt's a tucker.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.53,2:22:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯。\NHuh.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.71,2:23:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!哇，哇，哇，哇，哇，哇!你在干什么?\NHey! Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:12.59,2:23:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.62,2:23:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,家伙。\NHey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.37,2:23:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,呃，感谢所有的评论，特别感谢每个人关于雷管的建议。\NUh, thanks for all the comments and a special thanks to everyone for the tips on detonators.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.71,2:23:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,雷管吗?\NDetonators?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:52.80,2:23:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说，这将是我在一段时间内发表的最后一篇文章，呃……\NI just want to say this will be my last post for a little while, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.10,2:24:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这几周，这几个月，这个社区对我的意义，这么说吧，没有人…是孤独了。好吧?\Nwhat this community has meant to me these weeks, these months, let's just say none of us... is alone anymore. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.15,2:24:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.70,2:24:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,明天的选举日。\NTomorrow's Election Day.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:23.87,2:24:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,贝拉Reál将获胜。\NAnd Bella Reál will win.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.58,2:24:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她承诺会有真正的改变。\NShe promised real change.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.92,2:24:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们知道真相，不是吗?\NBut we know the truth, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.38,2:24:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经看到高谭市的真面目了。\NYou've seen Gotham's true face now.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:34.55,2:24:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起揭开了它的面纱。\NTogether, we've unmasked it.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:36.51,2:24:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它的腐败，它在复兴的幌子下伪装的变态。\NIts corruption, its perversion masquerading under the guise of renewal.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.47,2:24:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但揭开面纱还不够。\NBut unmasking is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.52,2:24:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,审判的日子终于来到了。\NThe day of judgment is finally upon us.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.61,2:24:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是报应的时候了。\NAnd now it is time for retribution.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.53,2:25:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我沿着城市的海堤停了七辆货车。\NI've parked seven vans all along the city seawall.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.16,2:25:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,在重要的夜晚，它们会爆炸。\NAnd on the big night, they will go boom.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.27,2:25:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当货车爆炸时，洪水很快就会发生，撤离将是不可能的。\NWhen the vans blow, the flooding will happen so fast, evacuation will not be an option.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.57,2:25:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那些没有被冲走的人将惊恐地穿过街道。\NThose who are not washed away will race through the streets in terror.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.79,2:25:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,戈登的电话。\NCall Gordon.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.87,2:25:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的。是的,是的。是的。\NYeah. Yeah, yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.59,2:26:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,随着突发新闻到达高谭广场花园的高地... ...庆祝活动将变成恐慌，因为会场将成为这座城市的最后避难所。\NAs breaking news hits higher ground in Gotham Square Garden... ... celebrations will turn to panic, as the venue becomes the city's shelter of last resort.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.60,2:26:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你们所有人的职责所在。\NAnd that's where all of you come in.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:18.03,2:26:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,时间一到，我就会被揭下面具。\NNow, when the time arrives, I will already be unmasked.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:21.40,2:26:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那些猪会把我关起来，不过没关系。\NThe pigs will have me in their custody, but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:25.78,2:26:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为到时候就轮到你了。\NBecause then it will be your turn.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.37,2:26:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你会在那里，等待着。\NYou'll be there, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:45.30,2:26:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,谎言终于该结束了。\NIt's time for the lies to finally end.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:48.31,2:26:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,更新的虚假承诺?\NFalse promises of renewal?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.52,2:26:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,改变吗?\NChange?
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.02,2:26:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要给他们真正的改变。\NWe'll give them real, real change now.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:57.90,2:27:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一生都在这个悲惨的地方受苦!\NWe've spent our lives in this wretched place, suffering!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.36,2:27:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,想,“为什么我们吗?”\NWondering, "Why us?"
Dialogue: 0,2:27:05.95,2:27:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们将在最后时刻思考，为什么是他们?\NNow they will spend their last moments wondering, why them?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:11.41,2:27:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我打不通!线路断了。\NI can't get through! The lines are down.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.09,2:27:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿,嘿!道路封闭的!\NHey, hey, hey! Road's closed!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.84,2:27:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想离开这里，伙计!\NI'm just trying to get out of town, man!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:23.55,2:27:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,女士，我们有炸弹爆炸了。整个城市都淹了。\NLady, we got bombs going off. The whole city's flooding.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.51,2:27:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你得和其他人一起进入花园。\NYou're gonna have to go inside the Garden with everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:38.11,2:27:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-副队，谁负责?-我真的不知道。\N- Lieutenant, who's in charge? - I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.86,2:27:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是想把事情搞清楚，先生。\NWe're just trying to get a handle here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.44,2:27:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,正确的。嘿,听!安静!\NRight. Hey, listen! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.36,2:27:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有活跃的情况。\NWe got an active situation.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.74,2:27:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得彻底搜查这栋楼，看看有没有炸药然后把当选市长带走，马上。\NWe need to sweep the building for explosives and get the mayor-elect out of here, now.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:47.41,2:27:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-她在哪儿?-我可以带你去。\N- Where is she? - I can take you there.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:48.41,2:27:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,来了!\NCome!
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.28,2:28:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-如果我们不关上门…——单片机。\N- If we don't close the doors... - MCU.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:26.78,2:28:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,.．.我们会有大麻烦的。\N...we're gonna have huge problems.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.74,2:28:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,水已经开始溢出了。\NThe water's already started to breach.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:29.20,2:28:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为这是最后的避难所。\NI thought this was a shelter of last resort.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.83,2:28:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊，对飓风来说，但如果整个海堤都塌了就不会了。\NYeah, for a hurricane, but not if the whole seawall comes down.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:33.12,2:28:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让那些人死在外面的。\NI am not gonna let those people die out there.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:35.04,2:28:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧。我去安抚一下人群，好让大家都进去。\NAll right. I'll go calm down the crowd so we can get everyone in.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:37.46,2:28:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这里不安全。我们得把你弄出来，Reál女士。\NIt's not safe for you here. We need to get you out, Ms. Reál.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:39.79,2:28:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-我哪儿也不去。-我们被攻击了，女士\N- I'm not going anywhere. - We're under attack, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.13,2:28:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,完全正确!这就是这座城市的问题所在。\NExactly! That's the problem with this city.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:44.05,2:28:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都不敢站出来做正确的事，但我不是。\NEveryone's afraid to stand up and do the right thing, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:47.13,2:28:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,——对不起。-女士…\N- Excuse me. - Ma'am...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:53.81,2:28:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,各位，各位，请注意。\NEveryone, everyone, if I could just get your attention.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:57.35,2:28:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托!我只是需要你的注意!\NPlease! I just need your attention!
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.54,2:29:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事!\NYou're okay!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.59,2:30:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!嘿!我怎么上去?\NHey! Hey! How do I get up there?
Dialogue: 0,2:30:50.30,2:30:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来,先生。\NFollow me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:01.51,2:33:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不,不。没关系。\NNo, no. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:03.10,2:33:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系。\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.31,2:33:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系。\NIt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:07.98,2:33:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在所做的。这是完成了。\NIt's done now. It's done.
Dialogue: 0,2:33:12.82,2:33:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这是结束了。\NIt's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:10.00,2:34:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!嘿，伙计，放松点!\NHey! Hey, man, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:14.17,2:34:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要着急。\NTake it easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:45.07,2:34:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.04,2:34:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁?\NWho the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.92,2:35:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗?\NMe?
Dialogue: 0,2:35:06.10,2:35:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是复仇。\NI'm Vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:39.98,2:38:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,周三,11月6日。\NWednesday, November 6th.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:45.48,2:38:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,城市被淹没了。\NThe city is underwater.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:49.69,2:38:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,国民警卫队来了。\NThe National Guard is coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:53.74,2:38:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,戒严令已经生效…但是犯罪分子从不睡觉。\NMartial law is in effect... but the criminal element never sleeps.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:01.50,2:39:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,抢劫和无法无天将在城市中无人能及的地方猖獗。\NLooting and lawlessness will be rampant in the parts of the city no one can get to.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:09.00,2:39:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经看到事情在好转之前会变得更糟。\NI can already see things will get worse before they get better.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:15.68,2:39:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,有些人会抓住机会，尽可能抓住一切机会。\NAnd some will seize the chance to grab everything they can.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:20.18,2:39:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将重建。\NWe will rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:22.18,2:39:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但不只是我们的城市。\NBut not just our city.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:24.35,2:39:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须重建人民对我们的制度、对我们选举出来的官员、对彼此的信心。\NWe must rebuild people's faith in our institutions, in our elected officials, in each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:32.90,2:39:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起努力，重新相信哥谭市。\NTogether, we will learn to believe in Gotham again.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:40.58,2:39:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在开始明白了。\NI'm starting to see now.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:43.71,2:39:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里产生了影响……\NI have had an effect here...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:47.96,2:39:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是我想要的那个\Nbut not the one I intended.
Dialogue: 0,2:39:52.26,2:39:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇不会改变过去，不管是我的还是其他人的。\NVengeance won't change the past, mine or anyone else's.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:01.43,2:40:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须变得更强。\NI have to become more.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:06.56,2:40:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,人们需要希望。\NPeople need hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:09.40,2:40:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,知道有人在等着他们。\NTo know someone's out there for them.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:15.40,2:40:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这座城市像我一样愤怒，伤痕累累。\NThe city's angry, scarred, like me.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:23.66,2:40:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的伤痕会毁灭我们。\NOur scars can destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:27.12,2:40:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,即使身体上的创伤已经愈合。\NEven after the physical wounds have healed.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:31.46,2:40:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我们能活下来，他们就能改变我们。\NBut if we survive them, they can transform us.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:38.47,2:40:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能给我们力量去忍受…还有战斗的力量。\NThey can give us the power to endure... and the strength to fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:49.27,2:40:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们生活。如你所见，高谭广场花园的蒙面治安维持者帮助拯救了数百名受害者的生命。\NWe are live. As you can see, the masked vigilante atop Gotham Square Garden helping to save the lives of hundreds of victims.
Dialogue: 0,2:40:57.78,2:41:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,就在急救人员拼命抢救伤员的时候，一个神秘的蒙面男子出现了，他英勇地把受害者从天窗拉了出来……这不是很可怕吗?\NAnd now as first responders desperately scramble to help the injured, a mysterious masked man emerges, heroically pulling the victims right through that skylight... Isn't that just terrible?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:09.75,2:41:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他…给你泼冷水?\NHim... raining on your parade like that?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:20.34,2:41:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么说的?\NWhat is it they say?
Dialogue: 0,2:41:23.51,2:41:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,“今天你在巅峰，明天……你是一个小丑。”\N"One day you're on top, the next... you're a clown."
Dialogue: 0,2:41:34.57,2:41:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你，还有更糟的事。\NWell, let me tell you, there are worse things to be.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:42.66,2:41:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿,嘿。不要伤心。\NHey, hey, hey. Don't be sad.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:46.62,2:41:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你做得很好。\NYou did so well.
Dialogue: 0,2:41:52.96,2:41:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道，高谭市喜欢回归的故事。\NAnd you know, Gotham loves a comeback story.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:08.89,2:42:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:10.81,2:42:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在，不是吗?\NWell, that's the question, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:42:18.57,2:42:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,谜语我这个……\NRiddle me this...
Dialogue: 0,2:42:23.41,2:42:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,“你拥有的越少，你的价值就越大。”\N"The less of them you have, the more one is worth."
Dialogue: 0,2:42:35.54,2:42:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一个朋友。\NA friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:03.53,2:43:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你要离开。\NYou're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:05.45,2:43:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,耶稣。\NJesus.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:08.29,2:43:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你就不能打个招呼吗?\NDon't you ever just say hello?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:14.96,2:43:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪里?\NWhere will you go?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:17.88,2:43:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道。北部。\NI don't know. Upstate.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:20.71,2:43:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bludhaven,也许。\NBludhaven, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:23.30,2:43:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:25.51,2:43:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我留下?\NYou asking me to stay?
Dialogue: 0,2:43:33.77,2:43:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这地方永远不会改变。\NYou know this place is never gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:36.31,2:43:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,卡迈走了，你的情况只会更糟。\NWith Carmine gone, it's only gonna get worse for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:38.73,2:43:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会有一场权力争夺。\NThere's gonna be a power grab.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:42.28,2:43:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,它会流血。\NIt'll be bloody.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:44.03,2:43:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道。\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:46.78,2:43:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是城市可以改变。\NBut the city can change.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:47.95,2:43:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它不会。\NIt won't.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:50.33,2:43:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我得试试。\NI have to try.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:51.41,2:43:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,它最终会杀死你的。你知道的。\NIt's gonna kill you eventually. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:55.50,2:43:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,听。\NListen.
Dialogue: 0,2:43:59.04,2:44:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不和我一起去呢?\NWhy don't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:01.26,2:44:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,惹上麻烦。\NGet into some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:03.51,2:44:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉一些对冲基金公司的CEO。它会很有趣。\NKnock off some CEO hedge fund types. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:07.68,2:44:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠和猫。\NThe bat and the cat.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:10.81,2:44:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,戒指很漂亮。\NIt's got a nice ring.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:25.82,2:44:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在骗谁呢?\NWho am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,2:44:28.70,2:44:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有人找你了。\NYou're already spoken for.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:42.71,2:44:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该去。\NYou should go.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:52.47,2:44:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,塞琳娜……\NSelina...
Dialogue: 0,2:44:57.56,2:44:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好自己。\NTake care of yourself.